Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn it，man！That was our ride！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just stunned our ride！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.13,0:01:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.43,0:01:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell did you take？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no idea，but they were bowing to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kirk to Shuttle One.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Locals are out of the kill zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are clear。Repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，get in there，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:02:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,neutralize the volcano and let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to do this now！I told the Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,the shuttle wasn't built for this kind of heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，did the indigenous life forms see you？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Mr。Spock，they did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Prime Directive clearly states
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,there can be no interference
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,with the internal development of alien civilizations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what it says！Which is why I'm running
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.18,0:02:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,through the jungle wearing a disguise！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now drop off your super ice cube and let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kirk out！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we're gonna do this，we've got to do it now！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,This ash is killing our coils.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sure you don't want me to go instead？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would be highly illogical as I am already outfitted…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys！We have to go！Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're trying to kill us！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're trying to kill us，Jim！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:02:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you in 90 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it，do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prerequisite change，2-7-3…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.87,0:03:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't hold this position.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，I've got to pull you back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Negative。This is our only chance to save this species.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,If this volcano erupts，the planet dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull him back up。Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,surprisingly，alive。Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll suit up。I'm gonna go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to abandon the shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't just leave him，Sulu！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uhura，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，we're going back to the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll get you out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，I'm ditching the shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got to make it to the Enterprise on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wonderful！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uhura！You ready to swim？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim！The beach is that way！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know！We're not going to the beach！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，no，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate this！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you do！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how ridiculous it is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,to hide a starship on the bottom of the ocean？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been down here since last night！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The salt water's gonna ruin the…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty！Where's Spock？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still in the volcano，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain on the bridge！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant，do we have an open channel to Mr。Spock？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,The heat's frying his comms，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we still have contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have activated the device，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,When the countdown is complete，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,the reaction should render the volcano inert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，and that's gonna render him inert！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do we have use of the transporters？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Negative，sir。- Not with these magnetic fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to beam Spock back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me one way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe if we had a direct line of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- If we got closer… - Hold on，wee man！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're talking about an active volcano！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，if that thing erupts，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannae guarantee we can withstand the heat！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know that we can maintain that kind of altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our shuttle was concealed by the ash cloud，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,but the Enterprise is too large.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,If utilized in a rescue effort，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,it would be revealed to the indigenous species.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，nobody knows the rules better than you，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,but there has got to be an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,None。Such action violates the Prime Directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up，Spock！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're trying to save you，damn it！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doctor，the needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，we're talking about your life！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rule cannot be broken…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try to get him back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ninety seconds to detonations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.81,0:07:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Spock were here and I were there，what would he do？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'd let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，you let them see our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bridge to Captain Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is Commander Spock on board，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Safely and soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please notify him that his device
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,has successfully detonated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear that？Congratulations，Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You violated the Prime Directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on，Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,They saw us。Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you say？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.41,0:12:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Jim。Come on，let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.81,0:12:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not actually gonna answer that，are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，I'm telling you，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,this is why he called。I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your feeling aside，I consider it highly unlikely
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,that we will be selected for the new program.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why else would Pike want to see us？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget about seniority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.87,0:13:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,They gave us the newest ship in the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，who else are they gonna send out？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can think of numerous possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.87,0:13:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,A five- year mission，Spock！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's deep space！That's uncharted territory！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think how incredible that's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，ladies。Jim Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「Uneventful.」 - Admiral？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the way you described
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,the survey of Nibiru in your captain's log.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir，I didn't want
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,to waste your time going over the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me more about this volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Data says it was highly volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it were to erupt，it would wipe out the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's hope it doesn't，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something tells me it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，sir，volatile is all relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe our data was off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or maybe it didn't erupt
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,because Mr。Spock detonated
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,a cold fusion device inside it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,right after a civilization that's barely invented the wheel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,happened to see a starship rising out of their ocean！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is pretty much how you describe it，is it not？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Admiral… - You filed a report？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I incorrectly assumed that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,you would be truthful in your captain's log.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I would have been if I didn't have to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,A fact for which I am immeasurably grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the very reason I felt it necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,to take responsibility for the actions…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take responsibility，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That'd be so noble，pointy，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you weren't also throwing me under the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Pointy」？Is that a derogatory reference to…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Starfleet's mandate is to explore and observe，not to interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Had the mission gone according to plan，Admiral，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,the indigenous species would never
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,have been aware of our interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a technicality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am Vulcan，sir。We embrace technicality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you giving me attitude，Spock？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm expressing multiple attitudes simultaneously，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,To which are you referring？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're dismissed，Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have any idea what a pain in the ass you are？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think so，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,So tell me what you did wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the lesson to be learned here？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never trust a Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，see，you can't even answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You lied。On an official report，you lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think the rules don't apply to you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,'cause you disagree with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why you talked me into signing up in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's why you gave me your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gave you my ship because I saw a greatness in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now，I see you haven't got an ounce of humility.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to do，let Spock die？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I am，sir。What would you have done？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have risked my First Officer's life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.70,0:15:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the first place！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were supposed to survey a planet，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,not alter its destiny！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You violated a dozen Starfleet regulations
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,and almost got everyone under your command killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except I didn't！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know how many crew members I've lost？Not one！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's your problem，you think you're infallible！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think you can't make a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a pattern with you！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The rules are for other people！- Some should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what's worse is you using blind luck
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,to justify your playing God！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Given the circumstances，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,this has been brought to Admiral Marcus's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,He convened a special tribunal，to which I was not invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You understand what Starfleet regulations mandate
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,be done at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've taken the Enterprise away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're sending you back to the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Admiral，listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，I'm not going to listen。- I can justify…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why should I listen？I'm not going to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't listen to anybody but yourself！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I understand regulation，but every decision I've made…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！I can't listen！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't comply with the rules，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,you don't take responsibility for anything，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you don't respect the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know why？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because you're not ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to need three titanium…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Radiation protection is required in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you find me？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you better than you think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:19:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first time I found you was in a dive like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember that？You got your ass handed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You don't？- No，that's not what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That was an epic beating。- No，it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You had napkins hanging out of your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you not？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that was a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「A good fight.」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think that's your problem right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,They gave her back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.03,0:20:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your back with that First Officer，though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock's not going to be working with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's been transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:20:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,U.S.S。Bradbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're going to be my First Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Marcus took some convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,But every now and then I can make a good case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.35,0:21:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you tell him？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,That I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,That if anybody deserves a second chance，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's Jim Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.01,0:21:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's going to be okay，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Emergency session，Daystrom.」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.36,0:21:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Suit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,All Starfleet personnel，please be advised，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- new security protocols are in effect。- Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.33,0:22:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not anymore，Spock。First Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was demoted and you were reassigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.51,0:22:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is fortunate that the consequences
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,were not more severe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.68,0:22:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，it was never my intention…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.84,0:22:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.35,0:22:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saved your life，Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.51,0:22:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wrote a report，I lost my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander，I see now I should have alerted you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,to the fact that I submitted the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm familiar with your compulsion to follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.53,0:22:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you see，I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where I come from，if someone saves your life，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.65,0:22:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,you don't stab him in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.03,0:22:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vulcans cannot lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.87,0:22:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I'm talking to the half- human part of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.89,0:22:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you understand why I went back for you？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.83,0:22:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander Spock？Frank Abbot，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:23:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,U.S.S。Bradbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guess you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.55,0:23:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.55,0:23:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,The truth is，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Admiral Marcus，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.11,0:23:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for convening on such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.41,0:23:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.91,0:23:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,By now，some of you have heard what happened in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,The target was a Starfleet data archive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.17,0:23:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now it's a damned hole in the ground，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.42,0:23:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,42 men and women are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,One hour ago，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I received a message from a Starfleet officer，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.42,0:23:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,who confessed to carrying out this attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.76,0:23:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,that he was being forced to do it by this man，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.14,0:23:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander John Harrison。He's one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:23:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he is the man responsible for this act of savagery.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.23,0:24:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,For reasons unknown，John Harrison has just declared
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.02,0:24:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,a one- man war against Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And under no circumstances are we to allow this man
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,to escape Federation space.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.94,0:24:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You here tonight represent the senior command
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.57,0:24:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,of all the vessels in the region.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in the name of those we lost，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,you will run this bastard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.12,0:24:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a manhunt，pure and simple，so let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Earth's perimeter sensors have not detected
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.21,0:24:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,any warp signatures leaving the system，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,so we know he can't be far.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will park your ships in a blockade formation
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.80,0:24:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,then deploy search vehicles and landing parties
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,to run down every lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.18,0:24:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,This man has shown willingness to kill innocent people，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.02,0:24:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,so the rules of engagement are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you come across this man and fear for your life
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.73,0:24:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,or the lives of those nearby，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.61,0:24:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,you are authorized to use deadly force on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.73,0:24:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's in the bag？- James，not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem odd to you that he'd target an archive？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.78,0:24:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like bombing a library.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.49,0:24:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chris？Everything okay there？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:25:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir。Mr。Kirk is just acclimating
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.16,0:25:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,to his new position as First Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.08,0:25:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got something to say，Kirk，say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.79,0:25:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.50,0:25:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine，sir。My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.17,0:25:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spit it out，son。Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.84,0:25:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why the archive？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,All that information is public record.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.72,0:25:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he really wanted to damage Starfleet，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.93,0:25:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,this could just be the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.69,0:25:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,The beginning of what，Mr。Kirk？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.35,0:25:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，in the event of an attack，protocol mandates
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.19,0:25:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,that senior command gather captains and first officers
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.15,0:25:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,at Starfleet H.Q.，right here
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.70,0:25:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- in this room。- It is curious Harrison
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.78,0:25:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,would commandeer a jumpship without warp capabilities…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear the room！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.25,0:25:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need an air defense team！Daystrom Conference Room！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.89,0:26:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go！- Cover me！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.94,0:26:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Target acquired。- Take him out！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch my flank！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go，go，go！- Cover me！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.45,0:27:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.65,0:30:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.78,0:30:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander，Mr。Scott has found something
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.40,0:30:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the wreckage of Harrison's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.57,0:30:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has asked to see us right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.70,0:30:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain！I found this in the crashed jumpship，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.83,0:30:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is how the bastard got away。- What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.67,0:30:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a portable transwarp beaming device.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.88,0:30:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，can you figure out where he went？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.34,0:30:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I already did，sir。And you're no gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gone to the one place we…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.68,0:30:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,we just can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.06,0:30:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Admiral，sir，he's not on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.89,0:30:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's on Kronos，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I request my command be reinstated
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.15,0:31:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,and your permission to go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.53,0:31:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.19,0:31:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kronos。- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.36,0:31:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,So Harrison's gone to the Klingon homeworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.95,0:31:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is he defecting？- We're not sure，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has taken refuge in the Ketha Province，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.20,0:31:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,a region uninhabited for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.29,0:31:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gotta be hiding there，sir！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.87,0:31:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knows if we even go near Klingon space，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.66,0:31:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,it'd be all- out war.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Starfleet can't go after him，but I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.46,0:31:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,All- out war with the Klingons is inevitable，Mr。Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you ask me，it's already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.80,0:31:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since we first learned of their existence，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.34,0:31:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Klingon Empire has conquered and occupied
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.56,0:31:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,two planets that we know of
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.81,0:31:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,and fired on our ships half a dozen times.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.44,0:31:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are coming our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.86,0:31:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,London was not an archive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a top- secret branch of Starfleet
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.11,0:31:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,designated Section 31.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.82,0:31:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were developing defense technology
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.32,0:31:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,and training our officers to gather intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.41,0:31:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,on the Klingons and any other potential enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.95,0:31:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,who means to do us harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:31:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harrison was one of our top agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.87,0:32:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，now he's a fugitive and I want to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.96,0:32:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pike always said you were one of our best and brightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.30,0:32:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should have heard him defend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.42,0:32:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the one who talked you into joining Starfleet，wasn't he？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.80,0:32:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.51,0:32:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did he ever tell you who talked him into joining？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.98,0:32:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,His death is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.65,0:32:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,And yours can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.77,0:32:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，please。All I…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.90,0:32:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Spock，you said the province
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.53,0:32:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,where Harrison is hiding is uninhabited？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.11,0:32:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Affirmative，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.74,0:32:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,As part of our defensive strategy，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.62,0:32:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,31 developed a new photon torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Long- range and untraceable，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.04,0:32:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,it would be invisible to Klingon sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.42,0:32:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want you hurt，but I want to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.51,0:32:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You park on the edge of the Neutral Zone，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.47,0:32:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,you lock onto Harrison's position，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.43,0:32:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,you fire，you kill him and you haul ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.51,0:32:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Permission to reinstate Mr。Spock as my First Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.03,0:33:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where were you？- For what？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.28,0:33:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your medical exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.82,0:33:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten hours ago，you were in a damn firefight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.87,0:33:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now it's my duty as ship's… - I'm fine，Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.37,0:33:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The hell you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.87,0:33:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.63,0:33:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Status report，Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.13,0:33:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Enterprise should be ready for launch
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.55,0:33:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,by the time we arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.30,0:33:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good。Good。- Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.72,0:33:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for requesting my reinstatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.31,0:33:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.56,0:33:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,As I am again your First Officer，it is now my duty
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.77,0:33:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,to strongly object to our mission parameters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.86,0:33:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.94,0:33:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is no Starfleet regulation
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,that condemns a man to die without a trial，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.19,0:33:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,something you and Admiral Marcus are forgetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.99,0:33:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Also，preemptively firing torpedoes
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.28,0:33:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,at the Klingon homeworld goes against…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.91,0:34:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You yourself said the area's uninhabited.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.70,0:34:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's only gonna be one casualty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.33,0:34:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in case you weren't listening，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.46,0:34:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,our orders have nothing to do with Starfleet regulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.75,0:34:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。We're firing torpedoes at the Klingons？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.42,0:34:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Regulations aside，this action is morally wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.59,0:34:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Regulations aside，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.29,0:34:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,pulling your ass out of a volcano was morally right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.38,0:34:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I didn't win any points for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.59,0:34:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，Jim，calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.68,0:34:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna take ethics lessons from a robot！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.26,0:34:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reverting to name- calling suggests that you are defensive
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.06,0:34:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,and therefore find my opinion valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.43,0:34:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wasn't asking for your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.02,0:34:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bones，get that thing off my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.02,0:34:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，our mission could start a war
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.74,0:34:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,with the Klingons
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.90,0:34:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it is，by its very definition，immoral.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.94,0:34:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should take the requisite time
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.65,0:34:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,to arrive at this conclusion for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.07,0:34:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.70,0:34:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Science Officer Wallace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.11,0:34:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been assigned to the Enterprise by Admiral Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.87,0:34:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are my transfer orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.12,0:34:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You requested an additional science officer，Captain？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.37,0:34:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.21,0:34:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Lieutenant Carol Wallace.」
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.46,0:34:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Doctorate in applied physics
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.96,0:34:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Specializing in advanced weaponry.」
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.88,0:34:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Impressive credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.34,0:34:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.47,0:34:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,But redundant now that I am back aboard the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.09,0:35:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,And yet，the more the merrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.60,0:35:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have a seat，Doctor。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.56,0:35:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shuttle crew，stand by for lift- off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.71,0:35:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！I'm not signing anything！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.46,0:35:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，get these bloody things off my ship！Captain！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.75,0:35:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there a problem，Mr。Scott？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.01,0:35:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，sir。I was just explaining to this gentleman
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.05,0:35:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,that I cannae authorize any weapons on board this ship
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.59,0:35:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,without knowing what's inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.80,0:35:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Scott raises yet another point…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.68,0:35:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Report to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.14,0:35:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.47,0:35:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Scott，I understand your concerns，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.27,0:35:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we need these torpedoes on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.39,0:35:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Due respect，sir，but photon torpedoes run on fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.98,0:35:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I cannae detect the type of fuel
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.65,0:35:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,that's in the compartments on these torpedoes
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.53,0:35:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,because it's shielded.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.65,0:35:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I asked for the specifications，but he said…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.24,0:36:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's classified。- It's classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.16,0:36:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I said，「No specs，no signature！」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.32,0:36:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.83,0:36:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flight check's complete。We're good to go，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.83,0:36:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you，Mr。Sulu。- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.83,0:36:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now if you'll excuse me，sir，I have a warp core to prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.42,0:36:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.79,0:36:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim，your vitals are way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.34,0:36:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Report to the med bay。Scotty！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.76,0:36:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to approve those weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.38,0:36:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know what this is，Captain？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have time for a lecture，Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.01,0:36:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you know what this is？- It's a warp core.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.93,0:36:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a radioactive catastrophe waiting to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.18,0:36:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,A subtle shift in magnetic output
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.06,0:36:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,from，say，firing one or more of six dozen torpedoes
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.10,0:36:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,with an unknown payload
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.69,0:36:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,could set off a chain reaction
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.61,0:36:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,which would kill every living thing on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.94,0:36:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Letting those torpedoes on board the Enterprise
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.60,0:36:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,is the last straw！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.53,0:36:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was the first straw？- What was the…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.49,0:36:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are plenty of straws.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.32,0:36:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about Starfleet confiscating my transwarp equation？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.04,0:36:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now some madman's using it to hop across the galaxy！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.45,0:36:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where do you think he got it from？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.54,0:36:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have our orders，Scotty！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.04,0:36:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.21,0:36:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is clearly a military operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.88,0:36:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that what we are now？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.51,0:36:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause I thought we were explorers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.34,0:37:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sign for the torpedoes，that's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.26,0:37:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，well，you leave me no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.05,0:37:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,but to resign my duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.51,0:37:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.14,0:37:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're giving me no choice，sir。I will not stand by…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.85,0:37:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not giving me much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.06,0:37:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you just make an exception and sign…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.35,0:37:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you accept my resignation or not？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.81,0:37:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.28,0:37:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.87,0:37:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are relieved，Mr。Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.71,0:37:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim，for the love of God，do not use those torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.89,0:37:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention。Warp core anti- matter containment check
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.11,0:38:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,in three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.32,0:38:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain！I'm so sorry about Admiral Pike.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,We all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.16,0:38:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you okay？- Fine，thank you，Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.59,0:38:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，Scotty just quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.17,0:38:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And your boyfriend's second- guessing me every chance he gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.35,0:38:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，that was inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.10,0:38:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just sometimes I want to rip the bangs off his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.19,0:38:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know，maybe it's me。I… - It's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.90,0:38:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.61,0:38:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，are you guys… are you guys fighting？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.78,0:38:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd rather not talk about it，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.86,0:38:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！What is that even like？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.54,0:38:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your ears burning？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.91,0:38:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain on the bridge！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.54,0:38:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.54,0:39:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Chekov。You've been shadowing Mr。Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.67,0:39:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are familiar with the engineering systems of this ship？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.09,0:39:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Affirmative，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.22,0:39:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.80,0:39:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're my new Chief。Go put on a red shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.27,0:39:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Retract all moorings，Mr。Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.77,0:39:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.36,0:39:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Docking clamps one，two，and three are released.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.87,0:39:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,All moorings retracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.17,0:39:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Uhura，open a shipwide channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.46,0:39:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.17,0:39:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Chekov，how we looking down there？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.17,0:39:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All systems nominal，Captain。- Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.47,0:39:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warp available at your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.05,0:39:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mr。Chekov.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.60,0:39:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right。Let's ride。- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.57,0:40:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Channel open，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.03,0:40:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention，crew of the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.58,0:40:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,As most of you know，Christopher Pike，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.75,0:40:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,former captain of this ship and our friend，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.37,0:40:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.84,0:40:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The man who killed him has fled our system
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.59,0:40:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,and is hiding on the Klingon homeworld，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.55,0:40:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,somewhere he believes we are unwilling to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.47,0:40:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are on our way there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.18,0:40:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Per Admiral Marcus，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.63,0:40:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,it is essential that our presence go undetected.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.14,0:40:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tensions between the Federation
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.85,0:40:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the Klingon Empire have been high.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.64,0:40:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any provocation could lead to an all- out war.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.74,0:40:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will personally lead a landing party
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.79,0:41:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,to an abandoned city on the surface of Kronos
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.17,0:41:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,where we will capture the fugitive，John Harrison，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.63,0:41:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,and return him to Earth so he can face judgment for his actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.97,0:41:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Let's go get this son of a bitch。Kirk out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.14,0:41:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，I believe you have made the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.65,0:41:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I can be of assistance，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.86,0:41:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would be happy to accompany you on the away team.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.61,0:41:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You？Happy？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.70,0:41:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was simply attempting to use your vernacular to convey an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.53,0:41:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.92,0:41:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,All personnel，prepare for the closing of payload bay doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.81,0:42:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Spock。You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.93,0:42:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing，Doctor？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.56,0:42:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Verifying that the torpedo's internal… - You misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.60,0:42:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing aboard this ship？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.69,0:42:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is no record of you being assigned to the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.69,0:42:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？That must be some sort of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.11,0:42:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,My conclusion as well，Dr。Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.28,0:42:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except that you have lied about your identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.20,0:42:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wallace is the surname of your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.66,0:42:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can only assume the Admiral is your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.25,0:42:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.21,0:42:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm aware that I have no right to ask this of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.88,0:42:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,But please，he cannot know that I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.72,0:42:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Engineering manually dropped us out of warp，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.98,0:42:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Chekov，did you break my ship？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.81,0:42:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，sir。I don't know what happened！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.52,0:42:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,The core overheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.73,0:42:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to activate the emergency stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.48,0:42:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,It must be a coolant leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.23,0:42:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need time to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.23,0:42:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sorry，Captain。- Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.90,0:42:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，time to our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.24,0:42:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty minutes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.49,0:43:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's 20 minutes in enemy space we were't counting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.70,0:43:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。We better hop to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.45,0:43:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's Spock？- Here，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.08,0:43:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're coming with me to Kronos.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.08,0:43:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant，how's your Klingon？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.25,0:43:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's rusty，but it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.29,0:43:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good，you're coming，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.71,0:43:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,This isn't going to be a problem，is it，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.83,0:43:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,you two working together？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.09,0:43:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.38,0:43:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.26,0:43:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll meet you in the shuttle bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.60,0:43:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim，you're not actually going down there，are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.10,0:43:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't rob a bank when the getaway car has a flat tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.90,0:43:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure engineering will have us all patched up
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.44,0:43:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,by the time we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.69,0:43:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that right，Mr。Chekov？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.73,0:43:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.11,0:43:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll do my best，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.24,0:43:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，you have the conn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.70,0:43:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once we're en route，I want you to transmit
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.45,0:43:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,a targeted comm burst to Harrison's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.79,0:43:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You tell him you have a bunch of real big torpedoes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.12,0:43:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,pointed at his head
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.41,0:43:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,and if he doesn't play nice，you're not afraid to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.38,0:43:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that a problem？- No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.34,0:43:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've just never sat in the chair before.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.34,0:43:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna do great.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.51,0:44:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim！Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.14,0:44:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just sat that man down at a high- stakes poker game
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.76,0:44:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,with no cards and told him to bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.02,0:44:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now Sulu's a good man，but he is no captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.56,0:44:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,For the next two hours，he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.77,0:44:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,And enough with the metaphors，all right？That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.94,0:44:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.48,0:44:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,make sure that K'normian ship is ready to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.16,0:44:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Acting Captain Sulu to Shuttle Bay 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.49,0:44:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please have the trade ship we confiscated
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.45,0:44:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,during the Mudd incident last month fueled and flight ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.21,0:44:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain Kirk is en route to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.63,0:44:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready to deploy，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.38,0:44:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenants，lose the red shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.47,0:44:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are K'normian arms dealers。Put those on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.68,0:44:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir？- Look，if this thing goes south，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.22,0:44:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,there can be nothing tying us to Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.22,0:44:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless of course you want to start a war，Mr。Hendorff.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.81,0:44:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，sir。- No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.35,0:44:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Me，neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.37,0:45:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am detecting a single life sign in the Ketha Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.17,0:45:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Given the information provided by Mr。Scott，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.33,0:45:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,this is most likely John Harrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.84,0:45:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，I think we found our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.46,0:45:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You let him know you mean business.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.80,0:45:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.84,0:45:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention，John Harrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.05,0:45:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Captain Hikaru Sulu of the U.S.S。Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.06,0:45:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,A shuttle of highly trained officers
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.54,0:45:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,is on its way to your location.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.39,0:45:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you do not surrender to them immediately，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.06,0:45:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will unleash the entire payload of
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.17,0:45:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,advanced long- range torpedoes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.32,0:45:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,currently locked onto your location.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.95,0:45:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have two minutes to confirm your compliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.03,0:45:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Refusal to do so will result in your obliteration.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.04,0:45:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you test me，you will fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.71,0:45:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.55,0:46:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,remind me never to piss you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.93,0:46:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will arrive at Harrison's location
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.68,0:46:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,in three minutes，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.27,0:46:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is unlikely that he will come willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.85,0:46:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I calculate the odds of him attempting to kill us
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.27,0:46:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,at 91.6%.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.73,0:46:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.36,0:46:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good thing you don't care about dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am sorry，Lieutenant。I could not hear what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.49,0:46:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.91,0:46:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I'd be happy to speak
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.99,0:46:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- if you're willing to listen to me。- Guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.16,0:46:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant，I would prefer to discuss this in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.91,0:46:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd prefer not to discuss this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.37,0:46:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our current circumstances…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.45,0:46:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you really gonna do this right now？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.96,0:46:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,What never seems to require your undivided focus…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.54,0:46:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Captain，just two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.21,0:46:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- is us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.50,0:46:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,At that volcano，you didn't give a thought to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.05,0:46:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,What it would do to me if you died，Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.47,0:46:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't feel anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.30,0:46:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.80,0:46:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm not the only one who's upset with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.00,0:46:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Captain is，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.10,0:46:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。Don't drag me into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.98,0:46:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,She is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.31,0:47:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your suggestion that I do not care about dying is incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.44,0:47:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,A sentient being's optimal chance
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.19,0:47:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,at maximizing their utility is a long and prosperous life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.36,0:47:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.57,0:47:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not exactly a love song，Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.24,0:47:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.78,0:47:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is true I chose not to feel anything
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.91,0:47:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,upon realizing that my own life was ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.96,0:47:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,As Admiral Pike was dying，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.25,0:47:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I joined with his consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.46,0:47:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,and experienced what he felt at the moment of his passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.96,0:47:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anger。Confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.38,0:47:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.64,0:47:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.39,0:47:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had experienced those feelings before，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.97,0:47:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,multiplied exponentially
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.48,0:47:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,on the day my planet was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.98,0:47:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Such a feeling is something
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.69,0:47:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I choose never to experience again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.40,0:47:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nyota，you mistake my choice not to feel
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.16,0:47:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,as a reflection of my not caring.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.49,0:47:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I assure you，the truth is precisely the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.50,0:48:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell was that？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.42,0:48:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？Where's their signal？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.84,0:48:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,It cut out。I'm working to get them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.35,0:48:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are being pursued by a D- 4 class Klingon vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.56,0:48:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought this sector was abandoned！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.64,0:48:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,It must be a random patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.93,0:48:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.11,0:48:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,This ship has no offensive capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.27,0:48:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's got us。Give me all six fuel cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.23,0:48:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.67,0:48:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn it！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.50,0:48:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're closing fast，bearing 285！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.34,0:48:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，there！There！We can lose them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.34,0:48:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you are suggesting that we utilize the passage
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.30,0:48:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,between the approaching structures，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.56,0:48:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- this ship will not fit。- We'll fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.52,0:48:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，we will not fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.91,0:49:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll fit，we'll fit！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.08,0:49:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I told you we'd fit。- I am not sure that qualifies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.96,0:49:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any sign of them？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.21,0:49:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Which worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.05,0:49:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We lost them！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.92,0:49:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or they're jamming our scanners.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.21,0:49:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or we lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.19,0:49:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're ordering us to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.53,0:49:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，they're gonna want to know why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.86,0:49:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they're gonna torture us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.16,0:49:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Question us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.87,0:50:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they're gonna kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.54,0:50:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,So we come out shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.54,0:50:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're outnumbered，outgunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.71,0:50:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no way we survive if we attack first.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.80,0:50:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You brought me here because I speak Klingon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.30,0:50:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then let me speak Klingon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,This isn't going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.44,0:51:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is our only logical option.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.65,0:51:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if you interrupt her now，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.75,0:51:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,you will not only incur the wrath of the Klingons
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.70,0:51:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,but that of Lieutenant Uhura as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.40,0:51:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lieutenant。- Thanks，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.05,0:55:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stand down。- How many torpedoes？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.51,0:55:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand down！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.17,0:55:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,The torpedoes，the weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.33,0:55:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,you threatened me with in your message.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.22,0:55:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many are there？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.56,0:55:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seventy- two.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.52,0:55:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.79,0:55:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,On behalf of Christopher Pike，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.33,0:55:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,my friend，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.29,0:55:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I accept your surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.49,0:56:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.41,0:56:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.68,0:56:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cuff him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.91,0:56:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bones，meet me in the brig.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.44,0:56:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.70,0:56:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.45,0:56:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Contact Starfleet，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.62,0:56:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,let them know we have Harrison in custody，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.21,0:57:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we'll be on our way once the warp core is repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.63,0:57:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.39,0:57:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why the hell did he surrender？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.73,0:57:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he just took out a squad of Klingons single- handedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.56,0:57:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.73,0:57:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like we have a superman on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.19,0:57:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.20,0:57:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put your arm through the hole。I'm gonna take a blood sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.26,0:57:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why aren't we moving，Captain？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.60,0:58:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,An unexpected malfunction，perhaps in your warp core
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.81,0:58:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,conveniently stranding you on the edge of Klingon space？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.81,0:58:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How the hell do you know that？- Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.48,0:58:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you'd find my insight valuable，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.61,0:58:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We good？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.66,0:58:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me know what you find.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.91,0:58:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ignore me and you will get everyone on this ship killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.75,0:58:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，I believe he will only attempt to manipulate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.51,0:58:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would not recommend engaging the prisoner further.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.80,0:58:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.69,0:58:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me explain what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.36,0:58:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.49,0:58:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I watched you murder innocent men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.90,0:58:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was authorized to end you！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.87,0:59:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the only reason why you are still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.24,0:59:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,is because I am allowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.20,0:59:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,So shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.37,0:59:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Captain，are you going to punch me again
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.88,0:59:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,over and over till your arm weakens？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.88,0:59:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clearly you want to，so tell me，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.30,0:59:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,why did you allow me to live？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.09,0:59:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We all make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.35,0:59:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I surrendered to you because，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.06,0:59:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,despite your attempt to convince me otherwise，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.14,0:59:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,you seem to have a conscience，Mr。Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.56,0:59:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you did not，then it would be impossible for me
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.82,0:59:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,to convince you of the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.90,0:59:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,23-17-46-11.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.78,0:59:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coordinates not far from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.24,0:59:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you want to know why I did what I did，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,go and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.58,0:59:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me one reason why I should listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.34,0:59:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can give you 72.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.75,0:59:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they're on board your ship，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.42,0:59:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have been all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.47,1:00:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suggest you open one up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.83,1:00:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what really bothers me，though？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.25,1:00:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the modifications，you know，the enhancements.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.59,1:00:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right？And then like that，I'm off the ship！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.09,1:00:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just for trying to do what's right！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.84,1:00:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what did you do anyway？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.55,1:00:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just stood there like an oyster，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.80,1:00:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,looking at me！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.14,1:00:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.31,1:00:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty，it's Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.93,1:00:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well now！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.52,1:00:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it isn't Captain James Tiberius Perfect Hair！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.60,1:00:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you hear that？I called him Perfect Hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.52,1:00:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are you？- Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.02,1:00:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you drunk？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.53,1:00:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I do in my private time is my business，Jimbo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.45,1:00:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to help me out with something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.86,1:01:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you take these coordinates down？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.28,1:01:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,23-17-46-11.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.99,1:01:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you writing？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.12,1:01:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，you don't think I can remember four numbers？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.29,1:01:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ye of little faith。What was the third one？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.88,1:01:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forty- six.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.05,1:01:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know exactly what you're looking for，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.30,1:01:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I have a feeling you'll know it when you see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.47,1:01:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You may have been right about those torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.47,1:01:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will consider that an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.81,1:01:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I will consider that apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.89,1:01:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are the one who quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.40,1:01:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You made me quit！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.36,1:01:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Scott？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.65,1:01:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.99,1:01:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The nerve of that guy！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.20,1:01:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not doing that man any favors！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.41,1:01:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.49,1:01:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，then！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.91,1:01:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you out of your corn- fed mind？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not actually going to listen to this guy？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.87,1:01:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,He killed Pike，he almost killed you，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.88,1:01:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,and now you think it's a good idea to pop open a torpedo
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.21,1:01:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,because he dared you to.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.46,1:02:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why did he save our lives，Bones？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.38,1:02:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Doctor does have a point，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.13,1:02:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't agree with me，Spock。It makes me very uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.64,1:02:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps you，too，should learn to govern your emotions，Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.64,1:02:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,In this situation，logic dictates…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.02,1:02:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logic？Oh，my God！There's a maniac
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.14,1:02:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,trying to make us blow up our own damn ship and…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.89,1:02:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not it。I don't know why he surrendered，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.73,1:02:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,but that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.23,1:02:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we're gonna open a torpedo。The question is how.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.65,1:02:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，Jim，without Mr。Scott on board，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.32,1:02:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,who exactly is qualified
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.82,1:02:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,to just pop open a four- ton stick of dynamite？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.11,1:02:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Admiral's daughter appeared to have interest in the torpedoes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.82,1:02:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,and she is a weapons specialist.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.41,1:02:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps she could be of some use.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.58,1:02:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What Admiral's daughter？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.37,1:02:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carol Marcus。Your new science officer
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.79,1:02:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,concealed her identity to board the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.25,1:02:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,When were you going to tell me that？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.38,1:02:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,When it became relevant。As it just did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.59,1:02:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are the torpedoes in the weapons bay？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.22,1:02:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Loaded and ready to fire。What are they？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.01,1:02:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。That's why I forged my transfer
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.43,1:02:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,onto your ship to find out why.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.76,1:02:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.60,1:02:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the way，if I caused you any problems，I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.43,1:02:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Carol Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.06,1:02:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- James Kirk。- Torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.94,1:02:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,My father gave me access to every program he oversaw，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.19,1:03:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,then I heard he was developing these prototype torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.94,1:03:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I went to confront him about it，
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.99,1:03:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,he wouldn't even see me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.61,1:03:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's when I discovered the torpedoes had disappeared
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.78,1:03:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,from all official records.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.29,1:03:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then he gave them to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.08,1:03:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're much cleverer than your reputation suggests，Captain Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.29,1:03:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a reputation？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.92,1:03:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，you do。I'm a friend of Christine Chapel's.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.63,1:03:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christine，yes。How is she？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.13,1:03:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,She transferred to the outer frontier to be a nurse.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.26,1:03:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's much happier now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.38,1:03:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.63,1:03:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have no idea who I'm talking about，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.80,1:03:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are we doing in here？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.89,1:03:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this shuttle prepped to fly？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.97,1:03:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.39,1:03:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Would you please turn around？- Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.98,1:03:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.56,1:03:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous to try and open
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.65,1:03:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,one of these torpedoes on the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But there is a nearby planetoid.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.49,1:03:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can open one up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.20,1:03:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I will need some help.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.49,1:03:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.08,1:03:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.83,1:03:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain on the bridge！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.58,1:03:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.12,1:03:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,have Doctors Marcus and McCoy landed on the planetoid yet？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.67,1:04:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.43,1:04:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're moving the torpedo into position now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.67,1:04:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Any activity from the Klingons？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.71,1:04:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.17,1:04:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if we're stuck here much longer，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.34,1:04:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,they will find us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.09,1:04:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Uhura，did you let Starfleet know
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.85,1:04:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,we have Harrison in custody？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.51,1:04:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir。No response yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.52,1:04:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Engineering to bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.35,1:04:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。Captain，can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.69,1:04:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Chekov，give me some good news.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.77,1:04:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,We found the leak，sir，but the damage is substantial.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.11,1:04:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.28,1:04:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any idea what caused it？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.61,1:04:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sir。But I accept full responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.70,1:04:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something tells me it wasn't your fault。Stay on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.79,1:04:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shuttle is standing by，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.38,1:04:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bones，thanks for helping out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.21,1:04:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。Marcus asked for the steadiest hands on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.59,1:04:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，when I dreamt about being stuck
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.13,1:04:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,on a deserted planet with a gorgeous woman，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.22,1:04:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,there was no torpedo！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.72,1:04:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。McCoy，may I remind you，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.32,1:04:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,you are not there to flirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.47,1:04:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,So how can these legendary hands help you，Dr。Marcus？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.10,1:04:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bones！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.22,1:04:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,To understand how powerful these weapons are，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.23,1:04:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,we need to open the warhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.39,1:05:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,To do that，we need to access the fuel compartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.06,1:05:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for us，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.19,1:05:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,the warheads on these weapons are live.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.90,1:05:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sweetheart，I once performed
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.94,1:05:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,an emergency C- section on a pregnant Gorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.40,1:05:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Octuplets.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.53,1:05:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,And let me tell you，those little bastards bite.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.82,1:05:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I can work some magic on your missile.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.58,1:05:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。McCoy，there's a bundle of fiber optic cables
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.54,1:05:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,against the inner casing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.04,1:05:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll need to cut the 23rd wire down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.08,1:05:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever you do，do not touch anything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you understand？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.92,1:05:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。The thought never crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.09,1:05:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。McCoy，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.30,1:05:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,wait for my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm rerouting the detonation processor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.43,1:05:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you ready？- And raring.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.55,1:05:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.56,1:05:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，the torpedo just armed itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.43,1:05:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The warhead's gonna detonate in 30 seconds，sir！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.06,1:05:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell happened？I can't get my arm out！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.73,1:05:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Target their signal。Beam them back right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.27,1:05:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The transporter cannot differentiate
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.73,1:05:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,between Dr。McCoy and the torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.07,1:05:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,We cannot beam back one without the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.86,1:05:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。Marcus，can you disarm it？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.57,1:05:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trying。I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.32,1:05:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim，get her the hell out of here！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.45,1:05:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！If you beam me back，he dies！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.24,1:05:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just let me do it！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.08,1:05:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten。Nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.91,1:06:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.12,1:06:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Standing by to transport Dr。Marcus
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.56,1:06:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,on your command，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.46,1:06:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four。Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.67,1:06:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.51,1:06:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deactivation successful，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.14,1:06:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。McCoy，are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.98,1:06:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bones！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.31,1:06:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.40,1:06:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're going to want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.13,1:07:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Delta team，
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.07,1:07:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,deliver your thrusters to loading dock 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.39,1:07:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,U.S.S。Vengeance，bridge crew
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.22,1:07:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,requesting entry to construction hangar.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.02,1:07:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are cleared to enter the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.24,1:07:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need a welding team on the number one nacelle.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.08,1:08:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.58,1:08:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What have we got？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.71,1:08:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's quite clever actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.75,1:08:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,This fuel container's been removed from the torpedo
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.00,1:08:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,and retrofitted to hide this cryo tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.51,1:08:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is he alive？- He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.93,1:08:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if we try to revive him
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.59,1:08:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,without the proper sequencing，it could kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.93,1:08:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,This technology's beyond me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.02,1:08:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,How advanced，Doctor？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.60,1:08:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not advanced。That cryo tube is ancient.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.69,1:08:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,We haven't needed to freeze anyone
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.83,1:08:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,since we developed warp capability，
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.69,1:08:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,which explains the most interesting thing about our friend here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.03,1:08:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's 300 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.25,1:08:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is there a man in that torpedo？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.96,1:08:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are men and women in all those torpedoes，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.38,1:08:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I put them there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.26,1:08:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.43,1:09:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,A remnant of a time long past.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.27,1:09:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Genetically engineered to be superior
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.31,1:09:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,so as to lead others to peace in a world at war.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.44,1:09:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we were condemned as criminals，forced into exile.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.65,1:09:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,For centuries we slept，
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.61,1:09:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,hoping when we awoke，things would be different.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.66,1:09:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,But as a result of the destruction of Vulcan，
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.12,1:09:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,your Starfleet began to aggressively search
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.33,1:09:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,distant quadrants of space.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.67,1:09:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,My ship was found adrift.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.26,1:09:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I alone was revived.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.50,1:09:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I looked up 「John Harrison.」
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.50,1:09:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until a year ago，he didn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.92,1:09:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,John Harrison was a fiction created the moment I was awoken
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.51,1:09:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,by your Admiral Marcus to help him advance his cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.01,1:09:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,A smokescreen to conceal my true identity.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.64,1:09:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.77,1:09:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Khan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.11,1:10:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would a Starfleet Admiral
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.11,1:10:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,ask a 300- year- old frozen man for help？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.91,1:10:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I am better.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.79,1:10:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- At what？- Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.62,1:10:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alexander Marcus needed to respond to
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.71,1:10:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,an uncivilized threat in a civilized time
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.88,1:10:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,and for that he needed a warrior's mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.38,1:10:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.88,1:10:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,To design weapons and warships.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.13,1:10:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are suggesting the Admiral
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.22,1:10:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,violated every regulation he vowed to uphold
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.18,1:10:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,simply because he wanted to exploit your intellect.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.43,1:10:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wanted to exploit my savagery.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.89,1:10:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Intellect alone is useless in a fight，Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.69,1:10:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You… You can't even break a rule.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.52,1:10:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,How would you be expected to break bone？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.15,1:10:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marcus used me to design weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.99,1:10:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,To help him realize his vision of a militarized Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.91,1:10:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,He sent you to use those weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.03,1:10:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,To fire my torpedoes on an unsuspecting planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.71,1:10:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then he purposely crippled your ship
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.58,1:10:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,in enemy space，leading to one inevitable outcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.55,1:11:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Klingons would come searching
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.21,1:11:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,for whomever was responsible，
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.09,1:11:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you would have no chance of escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.39,1:11:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marcus would finally have the war he talked about.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.89,1:11:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,The war he always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.06,1:11:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.73,1:11:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I watched you open fire
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.02,1:11:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,in a room full of unarmed Starfleet officers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.77,1:11:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You killed them in cold blood！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.61,1:11:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marcus took my crew from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.28,1:11:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are a murderer！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.53,1:11:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,He used my friends to control me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.41,1:11:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tried to smuggle them to safety
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.12,1:11:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,by concealing them in the very weapons I had designed，
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.42,1:11:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I was discovered.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.76,1:11:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to escape alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.93,1:11:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when I did，I had every reason to suspect
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.14,1:11:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,that Marcus had killed every single one
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.56,1:12:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,of the people I hold most dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.11,1:12:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I responded in kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.62,1:12:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,My crew
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.29,1:12:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,is my family，Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.16,1:12:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there anything you would not do for your family？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.25,1:12:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Proximity alert，sir！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.51,1:12:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a ship at warp heading right for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.34,1:12:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Klingons？- At warp？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.47,1:12:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.84,1:12:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We both know who it is。- I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.18,1:12:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not coming at us from Kronos.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.31,1:12:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant，move Khan to med bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.60,1:12:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Post six security officers on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.98,1:12:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.36,1:12:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain on the bridge！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.53,1:12:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,ETA of the incoming ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.19,1:12:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three seconds，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.36,1:12:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shields。- Aye，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.72,1:13:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're hailing us，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.23,1:13:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,On screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.56,1:13:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Broadcast shipwide，for the record.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.90,1:13:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.65,1:13:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Admiral Marcus。I wasn't expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.24,1:13:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a hell of a ship you got there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.24,1:13:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I wasn't expecting to get word
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.49,1:13:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you'd taken Harrison into custody
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.25,1:13:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,in violation of your orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.71,1:13:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.42,1:13:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,We had to improvise when our warp core
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.50,1:13:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,unexpectedly malfunctioned.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.55,1:13:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you already knew that，didn't you，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.67,1:13:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't take your meaning.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.18,1:13:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that's why you're here，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.76,1:13:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,To assist with our repairs？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.55,1:13:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why else would the head of Starfleet
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.26,1:13:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,personally come to the edge of the Neutral Zone？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.60,1:14:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，they're scanning our ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.44,1:14:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there something I can help you find，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.40,1:14:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is your prisoner，Kirk？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.11,1:14:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Per Starfleet regulation，
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.48,1:14:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm planning on returning Khan to Earth to stand trial.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.74,1:14:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.41,1:14:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You talked to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.12,1:14:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is exactly what I was hoping to spare you from.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.87,1:14:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I took a tactical risk and I woke that bastard up，
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.63,1:14:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,believing that his superior intelligence
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.25,1:14:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,could help us protect ourselves
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.79,1:14:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,from whatever came at us next.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.88,1:14:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.72,1:14:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now the blood of everybody he's killed is on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.97,1:14:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I'm asking you，
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.14,1:14:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,give him to me
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.98,1:14:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,so that I can end what I started.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.07,1:14:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what exactly would you like me to do
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.82,1:14:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,with the rest of his crew，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.24,1:14:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire them at the Klingons？End 72 lives？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.95,1:14:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Start a war in the process？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.62,1:15:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,He put those people in those torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.58,1:15:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I simply didn't want to burden you
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.16,1:15:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,with knowing what was inside of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.50,1:15:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saw what this man can do all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.50,1:15:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you imagine what would happen
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.94,1:15:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,if we woke up the rest of his crew？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.01,1:15:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What else did he tell you？That he's a peacekeeper？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.59,1:15:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's playing you，son，don't you see that？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.55,1:15:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Khan and his crew were condemned to death as war criminals.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.52,1:15:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now it is our duty to carry out that sentence
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.68,1:15:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,before anybody else dies because of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.69,1:15:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I'm going to ask you again！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.86,1:15:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,One last time，son.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.86,1:15:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lower your shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.03,1:15:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.70,1:15:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's in engineering，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.29,1:15:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'll have him moved
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.79,1:15:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,to the transporter room right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.96,1:15:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.55,1:15:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not drop those shields，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.63,1:15:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。Sulu。- Aye，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.72,1:15:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，given your awareness
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.80,1:15:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,of Khan's true location in the med bay，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.38,1:15:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,may I know the details of your plan？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.14,1:16:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told Marcus we were bringing a fugitive back to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.14,1:16:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.10,1:16:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Chekov，can we warp？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.64,1:16:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，if we go to warp，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.35,1:16:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,we run the risk of seriously damaging the core！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.56,1:16:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we do it？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.73,1:16:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Technically，yes，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.28,1:16:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I would not advise it，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.74,1:16:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Noted.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.74,1:16:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，set course for Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.99,1:16:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.20,1:16:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Punch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.54,1:16:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，at least we're moving again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.22,1:16:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you think you're safe at warp，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.84,1:16:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.76,1:16:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Uhura，contact Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.43,1:16:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell them we were pursued into the Neutral Zone
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.06,1:16:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,by an unmarked Federation ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.77,1:16:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Comms are down，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.36,1:16:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Permission to come on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.52,1:16:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.28,1:16:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gonna catch up with us，and when he does，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.69,1:16:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,the only thing that's gonna stop him destroying this ship is me，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.61,1:16:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,so you have to let me talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.61,1:17:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carol，we're at warp。He can't catch up with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.53,1:17:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，he can。He's been developing a ship
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.91,1:17:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,that has advanced warp capabilities…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.28,1:17:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain！I'm getting a reading I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.82,1:17:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are we？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.90,1:17:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're 237，000 kilometers from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.15,1:17:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Damage report！- Weapons are way down.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.28,1:17:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shields are dropping.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.91,1:17:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're defenseless，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.74,1:17:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，we have a bulkhead breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.12,1:17:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's the damage？- Major hull damage，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.62,1:17:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers！Get us to Earth！Right now！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.17,1:17:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain！Stop！Everybody on this ship is going to die
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.46,1:17:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you don't let me speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.17,1:18:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uhura，hail him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.63,1:18:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir。It's me。It's Carol.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.61,1:18:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing on that ship？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.44,1:18:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard what you said.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.78,1:18:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,That you made a mistake
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.03,1:18:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,and now you're doing everything you can to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.62,1:18:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，Dad，
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.33,1:18:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe that the man who raised me
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.12,1:18:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,is capable of destroying a ship full of innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.00,1:18:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，if I'm wrong about that，
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.80,1:18:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,then you're gonna have to do it with me on board.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.30,1:18:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，Carol，I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.98,1:18:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jim… - Can we intercept the transport signal？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.56,1:18:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.86,1:18:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carol！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.48,1:19:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain Kirk，without authorization
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.44,1:19:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,and in league with the fugitive John Harrison，
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.66,1:19:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,you went rogue in enemy territory，
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.62,1:19:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,leaving me no choice
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.74,1:19:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,but to hunt you down and destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.99,1:19:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lock phasers.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.67,1:19:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，sir，wait，wait，wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.41,1:19:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.50,1:19:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Target all aft torpedoes on the Enterprise bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.00,1:19:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，my crew was just following my orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.42,1:19:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I take full responsibility for my actions.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.05,1:19:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they were mine and they were mine alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.09,1:19:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I transmit Khan's location to you now，
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.26,1:19:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,all that I ask is that you spare them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.44,1:19:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.11,1:19:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.69,1:19:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just let them live.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.03,1:19:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a hell of an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.70,1:19:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if it's any consolation，
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.87,1:19:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was never going to spare your crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.96,1:19:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire when…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.73,1:20:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.24,1:20:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our weapons won't fire，sir！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.49,1:20:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our shields are down！We're losing power！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.82,1:20:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone in engineering just manually reset our systems！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.32,1:20:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean，「Someone」？Who？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.70,1:20:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their weapons have powered down。Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.41,1:20:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enterprise！Can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.79,1:20:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.00,1:20:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guess what I found behind Jupiter.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.13,1:20:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're on that ship！- I snuck on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.13,1:20:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,And seeing as I've just committed an act of treason
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.59,1:20:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,against a Starfleet Admiral，
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.26,1:20:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd really like to get off this bloody ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.51,1:20:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now beam me out！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.59,1:20:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a miracle worker.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.76,1:20:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're a little low on power right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.72,1:20:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stand by。Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.85,1:20:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean，「Low on power」？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.14,1:20:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to the Enterprise？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.06,1:20:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.11,1:21:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.52,1:21:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock。Our ship，how is she？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.36,1:21:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our options are limited，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.90,1:21:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,We cannot fire and we cannot flee.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.03,1:21:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is one option.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.41,1:21:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uhura，when you get Scotty back，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.25,1:21:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- patch him through。- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.25,1:21:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Spock，you have the conn.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.63,1:21:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，I strongly object.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.55,1:21:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,To what？I haven't said anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.46,1:21:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since we cannot take the ship from the outside，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.13,1:21:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,the only way we can take it is from within.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.72,1:21:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,And as a large boarding party would be detected，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.43,1:21:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,it is optimal for you to take
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.55,1:21:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,as few members of the crew as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.39,1:21:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will meet resistance，requiring personnel
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.02,1:21:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,with advanced combat abilities
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.14,1:21:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,and innate knowledge of that ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.23,1:21:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,This indicates that you plan to align with Khan，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.36,1:21:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,the very man we were sent here to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.48,1:21:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not aligning with him，I'm using him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.19,1:21:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The enemy of my enemy is my friend.」
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.24,1:21:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,An Arabic proverb attributed to a prince who was
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.36,1:21:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,betrayed and decapitated by his own subjects.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.16,1:21:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still，it's a hell of a quote.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.41,1:21:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will go with you，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.42,1:21:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I need you on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.75,1:21:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannot allow you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.58,1:22:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is my function aboard this ship to advise you
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.46,1:22:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,on making the wisest decisions possible，
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.96,1:22:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,something I firmly believe
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.13,1:22:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,you are incapable of doing in this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.75,1:22:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're right！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.51,1:22:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I'm about to do，it doesn't make any sense，
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.42,1:22:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's not logical。It is a gut feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.26,1:22:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no idea what I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.02,1:22:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only know what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.85,1:22:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Enterprise and her crew need someone
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.56,1:22:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,in that chair that knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.86,1:22:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.20,1:22:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's you，Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.39,1:23:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me everything you know about that ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.48,1:23:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dreadnought class.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.31,1:23:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two times the size，three times the speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.06,1:23:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Advanced weaponry。Modified for a minimal crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.98,1:23:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unlike most Federation vessels，
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.23,1:23:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's built solely for combat.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.07,1:23:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will do everything I can
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.99,1:23:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,to make you answer for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.50,1:23:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,But right now I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.25,1:23:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,In exchange for what？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.50,1:23:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said you'd do anything for your crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.34,1:23:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can guarantee their safety。- Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.01,1:23:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't even guarantee the safety of your own crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.69,1:23:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bones，what are you doing with that tribble？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.27,1:23:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tribble's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.69,1:23:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm injecting Khan's platelets
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.09,1:23:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,into the deceased tissue of a necrotic host.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.19,1:23:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Khan's cells regenerate like nothing I've ever seen，
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.74,1:23:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I want to know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.62,1:24:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You coming with me or not？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.46,1:24:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to do what？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.29,1:24:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're coming over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.01,1:24:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sulu's maneuvering the Enterprise into position as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.63,1:24:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,To this ship？How？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.34,1:24:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a cargo door，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.10,1:24:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,hangar 7，access port 101A.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.80,1:24:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to find the manual override to open that airlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.97,1:24:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you crazy？Whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.06,1:24:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just listen to him，Scotty。It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.02,1:24:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is not gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.48,1:24:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want me to open an airlock into space，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.35,1:24:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,whereupon I will freeze，die and explode！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.48,1:24:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant，from our current position，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.03,1:24:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,is it possible to establish contact with New Vulcan？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.65,1:24:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll do my best。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.91,1:24:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，what is the status of the other ship？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.33,1:24:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their systems are still offline.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.99,1:24:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm aligning our ship now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.28,1:25:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty，how we doing over there？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.95,1:25:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，I wish I had better news.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.54,1:25:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've locked out access to the ship's computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.79,1:25:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll have full weapons in three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.00,1:25:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,That means next time I won't be able to stop them
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.71,1:25:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,destroying the Enterprise。Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.30,1:25:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander，our trash exhaust is aimed at
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.38,1:25:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,access port 101A of the other ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.72,1:25:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，the ships are aligned.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.59,1:25:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.64,1:25:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scotty！- I'm in the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.92,1:25:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.06,1:25:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm running。Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.24,1:26:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa，hold on，now，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.82,1:26:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,This door is very wee。I mean，you know，small.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.95,1:26:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's four square meters，tops.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.12,1:26:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gonna be like jumping out of a moving car，
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.12,1:26:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,off a bridge，into your shot glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.25,1:26:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。I've done it before.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.92,1:26:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it was vertical.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.09,1:26:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,We jumped onto a… it was a…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.09,1:26:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter。Scotty…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.34,1:26:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you find the manual override？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.63,1:26:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,The manual override，Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.18,1:26:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not yet，not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.44,1:26:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，before you launch，you should be aware there is
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.19,1:26:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,a considerable debris field between our ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.19,1:26:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.99,1:26:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty，you good？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.11,1:26:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not easy！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.86,1:26:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just give me two seconds，all right，you mad bastard！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.79,1:26:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me this is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.96,1:26:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have neither the information
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.46,1:26:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,nor the confidence to do so，Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.46,1:26:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Captain，stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.13,1:26:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，you're a real comfort.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.96,1:27:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.09,1:27:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.26,1:27:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay！I'm set to open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.89,1:27:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.22,1:27:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.81,1:27:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.40,1:27:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.15,1:27:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Launching activation sequence on
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.07,1:27:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,three，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.53,1:27:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,two，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.41,1:27:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,one.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.67,1:27:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，Kirk is headed for collision at .432！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.59,1:27:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，there is debris directly ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.42,1:27:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.43,1:27:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！Jim，you're way off course！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.01,1:27:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，I know！I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.73,1:28:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.53,1:28:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use your display compass，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.11,1:28:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must correct precisely
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.24,1:28:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 37.243 degrees。- Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.62,1:28:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm working my way back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.45,1:28:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty，you're gonna be ready with that door，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.67,1:28:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing in here？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.46,1:28:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wee bit of maintenance on the airlock console。You're big.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.25,1:28:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Scott，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.63,1:28:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，he can't seem to hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.09,1:28:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm working on getting his signal back。Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.72,1:28:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Damn it。- Captain，what is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.64,1:28:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,My helmet was hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.72,1:28:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uhura，tell me you have Mr。Scott back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.56,1:28:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not yet。I'm still working on a signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.06,1:28:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,His communicator is working.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.64,1:28:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know why he isn't responding.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.91,1:28:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.86,1:28:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you Starfleet or private security？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.40,1:28:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show me your other hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.48,1:28:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because you look like private security.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.65,1:28:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Imminent collision detected！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.28,1:28:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Khan，use evasive action！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.36,1:28:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There is debris directly ahead。- I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.50,1:28:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，did we lose Khan？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.83,1:28:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.59,1:28:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm having trouble tracking him in all this debris.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.08,1:29:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was Khan hit？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.42,1:29:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are trying to find him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.00,1:29:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，you need to adjust your target destination
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.67,1:29:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,to 183 by 473 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.35,1:29:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，my display's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.68,1:29:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm flying blind.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.02,1:29:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，without your display compass，
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.77,1:29:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,hitting your target destination is mathematically impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.94,1:29:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，if I get back，
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.19,1:29:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,we really need to talk about your bedside manner.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.20,1:29:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander，he's not going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.74,1:29:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,My display is still functioning.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.45,1:29:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see you，Kirk，
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.17,1:29:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,you're 200 meters ahead of me
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.21,1:29:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,at my one o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.50,1:29:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come to your left a few degrees and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.18,1:29:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty，we're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.98,1:29:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need a warm welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.72,1:29:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you copy？Do you copy？Scotty？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.23,1:29:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you can hear us，Mr。Scott，
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.64,1:30:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,open the door in ten，nine，
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.62,1:30:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.56,1:30:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,That person counting down，
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.61,1:30:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- what is that？- eight，
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.69,1:30:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you're hearing things，mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.90,1:30:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Seven。- Mr。Scott，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.78,1:30:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Six，five
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.62,1:30:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,1，800 meters。1，600 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.03,1:30:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scotty，where are you？- three
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.45,1:30:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you copy，Scotty？Please！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.87,1:30:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.37,1:30:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sorry about this。- About what？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.62,1:30:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。Scott，open the door！- Open the door！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.95,1:30:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Scott，now！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.77,1:30:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.10,1:30:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's good to see you，Scotty。- Who is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.78,1:30:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Khan，Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.55,1:30:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty，Khan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.69,1:30:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.61,1:30:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.07,1:30:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know the best way to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.87,1:30:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's locked to stun.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.79,1:31:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theirs won't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.37,1:31:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try not to get shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.13,1:31:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander，I have that transmission as requested.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.30,1:31:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,On screen，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.30,1:31:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.64,1:31:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.48,1:31:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.32,1:31:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.53,1:31:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll deal with you in a…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.32,1:31:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am ashamed to be your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.58,1:31:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，we just had a hangar door open
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.49,1:31:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,on deck 13.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.67,1:31:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Khan.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.09,1:31:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're going to have full power
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.21,1:31:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we're walking？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.42,1:31:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,The turbolifts are easily tracked
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.67,1:31:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Marcus would have us in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.17,1:31:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,This path runs adjacent to the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.51,1:31:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,They know they won't be able to use their weapons here
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.26,1:31:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,without destabilizing the warp core，
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.60,1:31:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,which gives us the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.10,1:32:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where'd you find this guy？- It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.10,1:32:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will be brief.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.19,1:32:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,In your travels，
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.34,1:32:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,did you ever encounter a man named Khan？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.11,1:32:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,As you know，
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.28,1:32:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have made a vow never to give you information
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.70,1:32:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,that could potentially alter your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.53,1:32:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your path is yours to walk，and yours alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.88,1:32:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,That being said，
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.05,1:32:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Khan Noonien Singh is the most dangerous adversary
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.30,1:32:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Enterprise ever faced.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.22,1:32:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is brilliant，ruthless，
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.31,1:32:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he will not hesitate to kill
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.89,1:32:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,every single one of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.56,1:32:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you defeat him？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.23,1:32:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,At great cost。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.57,1:32:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,How？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.70,1:33:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mean to tempt fate here，but where is everybody？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.83,1:33:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ship is designed to be flown by minimal crew，
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.62,1:33:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,one，if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.75,1:33:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,One？I…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.27,1:33:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You all right？- Yeah。Where's Khan？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.11,1:33:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant，I need you to assemble all senior medical
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.53,1:33:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,and engineering staff in the weapons bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.86,1:33:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.53,1:33:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。McCoy，you inadvertently activated a torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.79,1:33:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you replicate the process？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.12,1:33:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why the hell would I want to do that？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.62,1:33:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you or can you not？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.12,1:33:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn it，man，I'm a doctor，
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.88,1:33:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,not a torpedo technician！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.13,1:33:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,The fact that you are a doctor is precisely
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.34,1:33:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,why I need you to listen very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.46,1:33:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.30,1:34:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.97,1:34:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.14,1:34:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,The minute we get to the bridge，drop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.81,1:34:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，stun him？Khan？I thought he was helping us.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.48,1:34:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure we're helping him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.41,1:34:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Power coming online，sir！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.91,1:34:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Retarget the Enterprise now。- Aye，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.35,1:34:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make sure he stays down.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.77,1:34:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Excuse me。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.94,1:34:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Admiral Marcus，you're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.44,1:34:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not actually going to do this，are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:35:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Admiral，get out of the chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.20,1:35:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better stop and think about what you're doing，Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.86,1:35:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better think about what you did on Kronos.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.08,1:35:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You made an incursion onto an enemy planet！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.95,1:35:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You killed a Klingon patrol.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.04,1:35:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even if you got away without a trace，war is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.46,1:35:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who is going to lead us？You？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.13,1:35:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I'm not in charge，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.76,1:35:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,our entire way of life is decimated！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.13,1:35:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you want me off this ship，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.97,1:35:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,you better kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.47,1:35:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not going to kill you，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.39,1:35:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I could stun your ass and drag you out of that chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.31,1:35:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd rather not do that in front of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.74,1:35:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You all right？- Yes，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.28,1:35:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.59,1:36:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen！Wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.10,1:36:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.60,1:36:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should have let me sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.28,1:36:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is the Captain，Mr。Sulu？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.61,1:36:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our sensor array's down，sir。I can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.70,1:36:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to make this very simple for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.87,1:36:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Captain。- Your crew for my crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.62,1:36:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.29,1:36:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are smart，Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.13,1:36:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.96,1:36:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Spock，give me my crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.97,1:36:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what will you do when you get them？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.68,1:36:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Continue the work we were doing before we were banished.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.26,1:36:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which，as I understand it，
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.32,1:36:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,involves the mass genocide of any being you find
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.71,1:36:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,to be less than superior.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.31,1:36:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shall I destroy you，Mr。Spock？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.64,1:36:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or will you give me what I want？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.90,1:37:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have no transporter capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.86,1:37:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fortunately mine are perfectly functional.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.90,1:37:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop your shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.49,1:37:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I do so，
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.52,1:37:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no guarantee that you will not destroy the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.99,1:37:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，let's play this out logically then，Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.58,1:37:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Firstly，I will kill your Captain
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.04,1:37:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,to demonstrate my resolve.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.04,1:37:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then if yours holds，I will have no choice
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.00,1:37:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,but to kill you and your entire crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.71,1:37:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you destroy our ship，
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.47,1:37:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,you will also destroy your own people.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.59,1:37:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your crew requires oxygen to survive，mine does not.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.51,1:37:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will target your life support systems
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.26,1:37:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,located behind the aft nacelle.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.64,1:37:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,And after every single person aboard your ship suffocates，
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.98,1:37:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will walk over your cold corpses to recover my people.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.03,1:37:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.20,1:37:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,shall we begin？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.20,1:37:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lower shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.46,1:38:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,A wise choice，Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.38,1:38:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see your 72 torpedoes are still in their tubes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.55,1:38:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,If they are not mine，Commander，
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.24,1:38:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.14,1:38:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vulcans do not lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.23,1:38:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,The torpedoes are yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.20,1:38:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mr。Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.20,1:38:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have fulfilled your terms.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.87,1:38:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now fulfill mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.29,1:38:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，Kirk，it seems apt to return you to your crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.42,1:38:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,After all，
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.88,1:38:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,no ship should go down without her captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.80,1:38:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's locking phasers on us，sir！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.48,1:39:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let us out of here now！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.82,1:39:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shields at 6%！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.66,1:39:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,The torpedoes！How much time，Lieutenant？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.74,1:39:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twelve seconds，sir！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.87,1:39:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crew of the Enterprise，
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.99,1:39:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,prepare for imminent proximity detonation.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.91,1:39:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's he talking about？What detonation？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.83,1:39:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,The torpedoes。He armed the damn torpedoes！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.13,1:39:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.43,1:39:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，their weapons have been knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.10,1:39:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not bad，Commander。- Thank you，Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.56,1:39:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bones！- Bones！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.53,1:39:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nurse！- I got you。I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.74,1:39:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.45,1:39:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good to see you，Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.62,1:39:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You helped Spock detonate those torpedoes？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.28,1:39:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn right I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.37,1:39:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,He killed Khan's crew！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.95,1:40:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock's cold，but he's not that cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.96,1:40:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got Khan's crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.12,1:40:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seventy- two human popsicles，
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.50,1:40:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,safe and sound in their cryo tubes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.80,1:40:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.68,1:40:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，the central power grid is failing！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.68,1:40:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Switch to auxiliary power。- Auxiliary power failing，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.48,1:40:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander，our ship's caught in Earth's gravity！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.74,1:40:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can we stop？- I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.08,1:40:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry！Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.08,1:40:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear the area！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.92,1:40:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Engage emergency lockdown！I hope you don't get seasick.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.00,1:40:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.09,1:40:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant，sound evacuation，all decks.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.72,1:40:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.88,1:40:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,As acting Captain，
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.03,1:40:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I order you to abandon this ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.85,1:41:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will remain behind and divert all power
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.58,1:41:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,to life support and evacuation shuttle bays.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.43,1:41:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evacuation protocols…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.19,1:41:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I order you to abandon the ship！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.81,1:41:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,All due respect，Commander，but we're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.95,1:41:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,One day I've been off this ship！One bloody day！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.08,1:41:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gravity systems are failing。Hold on！Hold on！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.00,1:41:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention，all decks.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.75,1:41:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evacuation protocols initiated.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.42,1:41:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Proceed to exit bays and report to your assigned shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.38,1:41:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,There won't be time for evacuation
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.76,1:41:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,if we don't get power to stabilize the damn ship！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.10,1:41:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can we restore it？- Only from engineering.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.77,1:41:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to get back to the warp core.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.10,1:41:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.40,1:41:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotty，we got to get the power back on！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.34,1:41:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.58,1:42:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scotty，we got to jump！- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.17,1:42:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jump！Jump！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.55,1:42:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.97,1:42:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Emergency power at 15% and dropping.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.55,1:42:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention，all decks.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.01,1:42:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evacuation protocols initiated.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.56,1:42:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Proceed to exit bays and report to your assigned shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.57,1:42:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jim？- Hold on！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.32,1:42:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.22,1:43:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got you，Captain！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.89,1:43:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Chekov。- Don't let go！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.69,1:43:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even if we get the warp core online，
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.01,1:43:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,we've still got to redirect the power！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.49,1:43:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's right，Captain！- What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.20,1:43:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone has to hit the manual override.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.36,1:43:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laddie，there's a switch…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.66,1:43:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behind the deflector dish！I'll flip the switch！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.03,1:43:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.37,1:43:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.72,1:43:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evacuation protocols initiated.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.55,1:43:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Proceed to exit bays and report to your assigned shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.14,1:43:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，divert any remaining power to stabilizers.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.10,1:43:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doing what I can，sir。Doing what I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.33,1:44:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Core misaligned。Danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.42,1:44:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，no，no，no，no！- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.17,1:44:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,The housings are misaligned！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.50,1:44:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no way we can redirect the power！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.50,1:44:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ship's dead，sir。She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.92,1:44:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，she's not。- Wait，Jim！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.97,1:44:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we go in there，we'll die！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.55,1:44:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you hear me？The radiation will kill us！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.85,1:44:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you listen to me？What the hell are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.18,1:44:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm opening the door。I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.44,1:44:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,That door is there to stop us from getting irradiated！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.73,1:44:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd be dead before we made the climb！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.44,1:44:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not making the climb.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.94,1:44:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Danger。Core misaligned.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.74,1:44:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Danger。Core misaligned.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.68,1:45:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we don't get power or shields back online，
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.72,1:45:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,we're gonna be incinerated on re- entry！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.08,1:47:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warp core is back online！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.37,1:47:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maximum thrusters，Mr。Sulu！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.01,1:47:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thrusters at maximum！Stand by！Stand by！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.79,1:47:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shields restored！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.30,1:47:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander，power online.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.20,1:47:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Spock，altitude stabilizing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.54,1:47:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.13,1:47:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are no such things.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.55,1:47:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Engineering to bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.05,1:47:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。Spock！- Mr。Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.38,1:47:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，you'd better get down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.39,1:47:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.41,1:48:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.66,1:48:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,The decontamination process is not complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.50,1:48:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd flood the whole compartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.75,1:48:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The door's locked，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.28,1:48:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's our ship？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.12,1:48:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.12,1:49:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saved the crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.79,1:49:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You used what he wanted against him.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.63,1:49:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a nice move.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.13,1:49:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is what you would have done.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.89,1:49:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this，
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.81,1:49:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,this is what you would have done.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.14,1:49:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was only logical.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.65,1:49:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm scared，Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.07,1:49:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me not be.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.25,1:49:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you choose not to feel？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.34,1:49:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.68,1:50:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now I am failing.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.44,1:50:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to know why I couldn't let you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.69,1:50:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why I went back for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.36,1:50:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because you are my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.20,1:51:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Khan！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.79,1:51:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,God，that was close！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.46,1:51:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Set destination，Starfleet Headquarters！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.84,1:52:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Engines compromised.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.17,1:52:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cannot guarantee destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.30,1:52:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Confirm order.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.05,1:52:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Confirm.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.70,1:53:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Search the enemy ship for signs of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.20,1:53:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，there's no way anyone survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.42,1:53:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,He could.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.29,1:53:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.16,1:53:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！He just jumped 30 meters！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.91,1:53:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we beam him up？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.16,1:53:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's too much damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.29,1:53:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no incoming signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.83,1:53:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it may be possible to beam you down，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.13,1:54:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.51,1:54:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stand by for coordinates。- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.43,1:54:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enter 3517 by 2598.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.05,1:54:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coordinates confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.95,1:55:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get me a cryo tube，now！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.59,1:56:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get this guy out of the cryo tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.26,1:56:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep him in an induced coma.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.67,1:56:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna put Kirk inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.17,1:56:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's our only chance to preserve his brain function.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.01,1:56:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,How much of Khan's blood is left？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.93,1:56:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.85,1:57:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enterprise to Spock。Spock！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.74,1:58:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Activate the cryogenic sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.92,1:58:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,McCoy to bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.04,1:58:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't reach Spock。I need Khan alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.54,1:58:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get that son of a bitch back on board right now！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.59,1:58:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he can save Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.30,1:58:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we beam them up to the ship？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.59,1:58:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,They keep moving！I can't get a lock on either of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.10,1:58:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you beam someone down？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.38,1:58:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.97,1:59:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.27,1:59:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，stop！Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.69,1:59:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's our only chance to save Kirk！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.66,1:59:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is it？- It's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.33,1:59:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's call him Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.41,1:59:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your father was captain of a starship for 12 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.83,1:59:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,He saved 800 lives。I dare you to do better.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.88,1:59:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be so melodramatic。You were barely dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.01,1:59:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was the transfusion that really took its toll.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.77,1:59:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were out cold for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.85,1:59:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Transfusion？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.93,1:59:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your cells were heavily irradiated。We had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.44,1:59:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Khan？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.77,1:59:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once we caught him，
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.07,1:59:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I synthesized a serum from his superblood.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.78,2:00:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me，are you feeling homicidal？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.45,2:00:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Power mad？Despotic？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.20,2:00:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,No more than usual.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.28,2:00:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,How'd you catch him？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.87,2:00:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.04,2:00:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.84,2:00:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uhura and I had something to do with it，too，you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.88,2:00:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saved my life，Captain。And the lives…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.64,2:00:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock，just…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.68,2:00:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.35,2:00:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are welcome，Jim.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.32,2:00:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,There will always be those who mean to do us harm.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.66,2:00:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,To stop them，
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.66,2:00:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,we risk awakening the same evil within ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.59,2:01:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our first instinct is to seek revenge
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.26,2:01:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,when those we love are taken from us.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.64,2:01:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,But that's not who we are.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.93,2:01:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are here today
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.73,2:01:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,to rechristen the U.S.S。Enterprise，
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.73,2:01:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,and to honor those who lost their lives nearly one year ago.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.69,2:01:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,When Christopher Pike first gave me his ship，
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.95,2:01:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,he had me recite the Captain's Oath，
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.28,2:01:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,words I didn't appreciate at the time.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.79,2:01:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I see them as a call for us to remember
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.62,2:01:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,who we once were，
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.38,2:01:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and who we must be again.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.05,2:01:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,And those words？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.22,2:01:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Space，the final frontier.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.72,2:01:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are the voyages of the starship Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.31,2:01:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her five- year mission，
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.23,2:01:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,to explore strange new worlds，
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.81,2:02:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,to seek out new life and new civilizations，
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.98,2:02:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,to boldly go where no one has gone before.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.74,2:02:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.75,2:02:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's hard to get out of it once you've had a taste，
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.16,2:02:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,isn't that right，Mr。Sulu？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.75,2:02:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Captain」 does have a nice ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.17,2:02:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chair's all yours，sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.42,2:02:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Scott.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.09,2:02:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's our core？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.17,2:02:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Purring like a kitten，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.84,2:02:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's ready for a long journey.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.22,2:02:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.51,2:02:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Bones！It's gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.27,2:02:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Five years in space。God help me.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.81,2:02:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.61,2:02:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm glad you could be a part of the family.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.90,2:02:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's nice to have a family.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.03,2:02:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spock.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.36,2:02:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.45,2:02:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where shall we go？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.29,2:02:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a mission of this duration has never been attempted，
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.46,2:03:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I defer to your good judgment，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.97,2:03:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Sulu，take us out.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.07,2:03:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:04.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（M级行星 尼比卢）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没搞错 这是我们的坐骑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我们的坐骑给击晕了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.13,0:01:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.43,0:01:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底拿走了什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 但那些人对着它鞠躬来着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯克呼叫一号穿梭机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地人已经离开危险区域
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以行动 重复
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 快进去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:02:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把火山停息下来然后一起离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就要行动了 我跟舰长说了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这穿梭机承受不了这样的高温
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 那些土著有没有看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 斯波克先生 他们没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高指导原则明确规定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星文明的内部发展
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这个规定 所以我才
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.18,0:02:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着伪装在丛林里狂奔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把你的超级冰块扔下去然后走人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯克通话完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行动就没机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,火山灰正在损坏我们的线圈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你不要我替你下去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这想法极不合逻辑 因为我已着装完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 我开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能行的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 要出发了 快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想杀掉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想杀掉我们 吉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:02:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们90秒后见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,先决条件改变 2-7-3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:27.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（引擎过热）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.87,0:03:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法稳住飞船了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 我得把你拉回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 这是拯救这个物种的唯一机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果火山爆发 这星球就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他拉上来 马上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然还活着 待命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把他弄回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去换装备 我要下去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要弃船了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下他 苏鲁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌胡拉 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 我们现在要回进取号
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你救出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我要弃船了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要自己想办法回进取号
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,太「好」了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌胡拉 准备好游泳了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 海滩在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我们不去海滩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道把一艘星舰藏在海底
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是多么荒唐的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从昨晚开始我们就待在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,海水会破坏掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科 斯波克在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在火山里 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长到达舰桥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 能联系上斯波克先生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,高温正在损坏他的通讯设备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还能联系上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经将装置启动 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数计时结束后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,火山的喷发应该能被阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 同时他也会没命
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能用传送装置吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 长官 - 这里的磁场太强
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把斯波克传送回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我想个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能直接看到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果我们靠近点 - 等等 小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是座活火山
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 如果那东西喷发了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法保证我们能承受住那种高温
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我们是否能维持在那种高度上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿梭机能藏在灰云里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是进取号太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果用它进行营救任务
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些土著就会发现它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 没有人比你更清楚那些规定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是总有破例的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 这种行为会违反最高指导原则
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在想办法救你 该死的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 多数人之需重于少数人之求
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 这可是你的性命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,人可死 规矩不可破
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,想办法重新联系上他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,离爆炸还有90秒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.81,0:07:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我和斯波克互换了位置 他会怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会让你死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 你让他们看到了我们的星舰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰桥呼叫柯克舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请讲 上尉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校斯波克在船上了吗 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫发无伤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉他 他的装置
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,已成功引爆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 恭喜你 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拯救了这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违反了最高指导原则
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不就是被他们看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:17.61,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星际迷航：暗黑无界》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:47.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦 2259年55日）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:10.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（皇家儿童医院）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能救她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.41,0:12:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能救她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 别管它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.81,0:12:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要接那电话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:56.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（旧金山星际舰队总部）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打电话就是为了这事 我有预感
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你的预感 我觉得我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,入选这次新项目的可能性极小
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那派克为什么要见我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛开资历不说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.87,0:13:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给了我们舰队里最新的星舰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还能派谁去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能想到很多种可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.87,0:13:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年的任务 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是深空 无人踏足过的领域
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想那有多酷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女们 我是吉姆·柯克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「无事发生」 - 上将
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在舰长日志里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这么描述尼比卢勘测任务的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 我不想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让您浪费时间过目那些细节
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我说说这火山
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据表明它极度不稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果爆发了 就会毁掉整个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它不会爆发 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,直觉告诉我它不会爆发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 不稳定都是相对的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们的数据有误
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 它没爆发的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在里面引爆了一枚冷凝弹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还让一个连轮子都没发明出来的文明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,目睹了一艘星舰在海洋里升起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这么描述的 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上将 - 你在报告里说了这事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错误地认为
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在舰长日志里如实描述
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是为了救你我也不会隐瞒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我非常感激
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时这也正是我觉得有必要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这个行为承担责任的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责任 说得好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真够高尚的 尖耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有恩将仇报的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「尖耳朵」 你这是在贬低…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰队的任务是探索和观察 而不是干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那次任务能按计划进行 上将
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些土著绝对不会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,察觉到我们的干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是计划能完美执行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是瓦肯人 长官 我们追求完美
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这种态度吗 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在同时表达多种态度 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,您指的是哪种
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走了 中校
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道你有多让人头疼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你做错了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,学到了什么教训
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要相信瓦肯人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至不好好回答问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎了 在官方文件里撒谎了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你不赞成那些规章制度
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能不受它们的约束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,您当初要我加入正是因为我不守规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是为什么您给了我您的船
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把船给你是因为我之前觉得你会成大器
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 我却发现你毫无谦逊之心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我该怎么办 让斯波克死吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听懂我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 长官 是你你会怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本就不会拿我的大副的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.70,0:15:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,性命去冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们本该去调查一个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是改变它的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违反了一堆舰队规定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还几乎让你的手下全部丧命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们没死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我损失过多少船员吗 一个也没
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的问题 你觉得你很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你不会犯错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一向都是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以为规定是给别人看的 - 有些应该是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟的是 你仗着自己运气好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就以为自己是上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次事关重大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经引起了马科斯上将的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他召集了一次特别法庭 但没有邀请我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己明白 按舰队的规定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会受到怎样的处罚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经收回了进取号
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要把你送回学院
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,上将 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我不听 - 我可以解释
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要听 我不听
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只听自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白那些规定 但我所做的每个决定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不能听
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不服从规定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不为任何事情负责任
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不拿舰长这位置当回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你还没有准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:47.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:10.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（开尔文纪念档案馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要三个钛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入此区域前请做好防辐射措施
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:18:57.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（传送完毕）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你想像中更了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:19:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次看到你就是在这种破酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗 你被人打得满地找牙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有吗 - 没有 事实不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被揍了个半死 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的鼻孔里插了一大坨纸巾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次打得真爽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「打得真爽」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这就是你的问题所在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把她还给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,进取号
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.03,0:20:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,多提防那位大副
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克不会当我的大副
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被调职了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:20:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,调去了联邦星舰布拉德伯里号
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来当我的大副
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯是个很难说服的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我偶尔也能说动他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.35,0:21:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他怎么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了实话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人有资格改过自新
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这个人只能是吉姆·柯克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还是头一次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.01,0:21:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「紧急会议 地点戴斯图姆」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也得去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.36,0:21:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去穿上制服
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有星际舰队人员请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新安全规定已生效 - 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.33,0:22:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经不是了 斯波克 现在是大副
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被降级了 而你被调职了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.51,0:22:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很幸运后果没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,比这个更严重
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.68,0:22:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我从没打算要…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.84,0:22:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.35,0:22:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你的命 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.51,0:22:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你写了一份报告 我的星舰就没了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 我现在觉得当初应该告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我交了那份报告
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我很清楚你循规蹈矩的强迫症
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.53,0:22:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球人的规矩是 如果有人救了你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.65,0:22:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不该暗算他
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.03,0:22:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦肯人不能撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.87,0:22:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就是在跟你人类的那一半说话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.89,0:22:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道我为什么要回去救你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.83,0:22:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克中校吗 我是弗兰克·阿伯特
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:23:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦星舰布拉德伯里号舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的手下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.55,0:23:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.55,0:23:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想念你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯上将 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.11,0:23:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢大家能在这么短时间内集合
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.41,0:23:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.91,0:23:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们当中有些人已经听说伦敦的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,被袭击的是星际舰队的一个档案馆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.17,0:23:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在那里只剩一个大坑了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.42,0:23:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了42个人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小时前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到一位舰队官员的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.42,0:23:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他承认这次袭击是他干的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.76,0:23:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人逼他干的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.14,0:23:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人是中校约翰·哈里森 我们的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:23:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这起恐怖袭击的始作俑者
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.23,0:24:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,出于某种未知的原因 约翰·哈里森
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.02,0:24:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只身向星际舰队宣战了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我们都不能让这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃出联邦领空
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.94,0:24:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚在座各位涵盖了本星区
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.57,0:24:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有星舰的高级将领
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们失去的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要抓住这畜生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.12,0:24:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,简而言之 这是一次追捕 动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球周边传感器尚未检测出
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.21,0:24:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何曲速迹象离开地球
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他还没走远
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有星舰排成封锁队形
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.80,0:24:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出搜索舰和陆上部队
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不放过任何一个线索
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.18,0:24:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人会杀害无辜民众
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.02,0:24:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以交战规则很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你遇到此人 担心他伤及自己
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.73,0:24:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或周围的人的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.61,0:24:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权使用致命武器
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.73,0:24:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 包里是什么 - 詹姆斯 等等再说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他袭击档案馆 你不觉得奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.78,0:24:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像去炸图书馆
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.49,0:24:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯 有事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:25:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 长官 柯克先生只是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.16,0:25:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不太习惯当大副
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.08,0:25:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果有话要说 柯克 就说出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.79,0:25:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,留到明天就晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.50,0:25:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没话要说 长官 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.17,0:25:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 孩子 别害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.84,0:25:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要袭击档案馆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里所有的信息都是公开的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.72,0:25:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他真想毁灭星际舰队
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.93,0:25:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也许只是开始
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.69,0:25:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么的开始 柯克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.35,0:25:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 按照规定 一旦发生袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.19,0:25:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,高级将领必须将所有舰长和大副
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.15,0:25:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,召集到星际舰队总部这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.70,0:25:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个房间 - 奇怪的是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.78,0:25:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈里森抢了一艘没有曲速飞行能力的飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.25,0:25:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要防空兵 戴斯图姆会议厅
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.89,0:26:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 掩护我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.94,0:26:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已瞄准目标 - 带他出去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,留心我侧面
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走走走 - 掩护我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.45,0:27:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.65,0:30:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.78,0:30:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 斯科特先生在哈里森的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.40,0:30:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船残骸里发现了一些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.57,0:30:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要立刻见我们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.70,0:30:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我在飞船里发现了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.83,0:30:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那畜生就是这样逃走的 - 什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.67,0:30:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是便携式超曲速传送装置
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.88,0:30:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能找出他去哪里了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.34,0:30:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出了 长官 你不会喜欢那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去了唯一一个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.68,0:30:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去不了的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.06,0:30:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,上将 他不在地球
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.89,0:30:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在克隆那斯 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求复职
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.15,0:31:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,并请您允许我去追捕他
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.53,0:31:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们稍后再议
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.19,0:31:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克隆那斯 - 是的 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.36,0:31:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说哈里森去了克林贡人的母星
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.95,0:31:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他叛变了吗 - 不确定 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在凯萨区避难
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.20,0:31:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里几十年来都没人居住过
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.29,0:31:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定藏在那里 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.87,0:31:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道如果我们靠近克林贡人的地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.66,0:31:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会爆发全面战争
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队不能去追捕他 但我能
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,求您了 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.46,0:31:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,和克林贡人的全面战争在所难免 柯克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 战争已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.80,0:31:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我们知道他们的存在以来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.34,0:31:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林贡帝国已经侵占了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.56,0:31:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个我们已知的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.81,0:31:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,并数次向我们的星舰开火
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.44,0:31:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经磨刀霍霍
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.86,0:31:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伦敦被毁的不是档案馆
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是星际舰队的绝密分支
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.11,0:31:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,代号31区
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.82,0:31:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的人员负责发展防御技术
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.32,0:31:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,培训我们的军官 用于搜集克林贡人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.41,0:31:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和任何可能对我们有害的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.95,0:31:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜在敌人的情报
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:31:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈里森就是其中一位高级特工
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.87,0:32:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他是一个逃犯 我要消灭他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.96,0:32:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,派克总说你是最好的 也是最有前途的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.30,0:32:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该听听他是怎么为你辩护的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.42,0:32:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他劝你加入星际舰队的 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.80,0:32:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.51,0:32:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有告诉你是谁劝他加入的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.98,0:32:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死责任在我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.65,0:32:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再让你去送死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.77,0:32:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 求您了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.90,0:32:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生 你说哈里森
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.53,0:32:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏身的地区无人居住
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.11,0:32:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.74,0:32:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为我们防御战略的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.62,0:32:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,31区开发了一种新型光子鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,远程射击 无迹可寻
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.04,0:32:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以避开克林贡人的传感器
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.42,0:32:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想你出事 但是我也想消灭他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.51,0:32:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你停在中立区的边缘
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.47,0:32:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定哈里森的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.43,0:32:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火 干掉他 立马离开
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.51,0:32:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许斯波克先生继续做我的大副
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,批准
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.03,0:33:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪了 - 干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.28,0:33:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,体验
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.82,0:33:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,10个小时前 你刚和敌人交过火
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.87,0:33:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我作为星舰医生 - 我没事 老骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.37,0:33:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点也不像没事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.87,0:33:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.63,0:33:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况如何 斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.13,0:33:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,进取号在我们到达时
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.55,0:33:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该可以出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.30,0:33:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 很好 - 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.72,0:33:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你请求让我复职
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.31,0:33:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.56,0:33:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我重新成为了你的大副 我有责任
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.77,0:33:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,强烈反对本次任务的执行方式
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.86,0:33:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.94,0:33:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有哪条星际舰队的规定表明
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以不经审判判处一个人死刑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.19,0:33:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和马科斯上将都忘了这点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.99,0:33:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 率先向克林贡人的母星
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.28,0:33:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射鱼雷违反了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.91,0:34:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也说那地方无人居住
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.70,0:34:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以只会有一个人死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.33,0:34:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你刚才没仔细听
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.46,0:34:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务和星际舰队规定无关
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.75,0:34:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们要向克林贡人发射鱼雷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.42,0:34:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,且不谈规定 这种做法也不合道义
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.59,0:34:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,且不谈规定
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.29,0:34:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你救离火山很合道义
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.38,0:34:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我没得到什么好处
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.59,0:34:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.68,0:34:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让一个机器人给我上道德课
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.26,0:34:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次开始骂人说明你怀有戒心
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.06,0:34:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 我的意见是正确的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.43,0:34:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没问你意见
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.02,0:34:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老骨头 把那东西从我脸上拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.02,0:34:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我们的任务可能会引发
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.74,0:34:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,和克林贡人的战争
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.90,0:34:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且十分不合道义
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.94,0:34:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该花点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.65,0:34:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己得出这个结论
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.07,0:34:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯克舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.70,0:34:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是科学专员华莱士
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.11,0:34:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,受马科斯上将指派来进取号
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.87,0:34:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的调任令
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.12,0:34:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有请求增加一名科学专员吗 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.37,0:34:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.21,0:34:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔·华莱士上尉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.46,0:34:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,应用物理学博士
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.96,0:34:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,擅长领域 先进武器
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.88,0:34:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,简历很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.34,0:34:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.47,0:34:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我回到了进取号 这样就多余了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.09,0:35:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,多多益善
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.60,0:35:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请坐 博士 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.56,0:35:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿梭机机组人员 准备升空
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.71,0:35:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我什么都不会签的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.46,0:35:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些该死的东西撤下我的船 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.75,0:35:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗 斯科特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.01,0:35:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 我正在向这位先生解释
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.05,0:35:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能允许这艘星舰搭载任何
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.59,0:35:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,内部构造未知的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.80,0:35:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特先生的话的意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.68,0:35:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,向舰桥报到
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.14,0:35:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.47,0:35:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特先生 我明白你的担忧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.27,0:35:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们需要这些鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.39,0:35:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 长官 光子鱼雷需要燃料
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.98,0:35:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我检测不出这些鱼雷的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.65,0:35:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料舱里装的是什么燃料
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.53,0:35:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为燃料舱被屏蔽了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.65,0:35:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问他要规格说明 但他说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.24,0:36:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是机密 - 这是机密
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.16,0:36:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我说 不给规格说明 不签字
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.32,0:36:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.83,0:36:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行检查完成 随时可以起飞 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.83,0:36:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 苏鲁先生 - 不谢 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.83,0:36:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我失陪 长官 我还要启动曲速核
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.42,0:36:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.79,0:36:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 你的身体状况不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.34,0:36:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告给医务舱 小科
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.76,0:36:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你批准这些武器登舰
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.38,0:36:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么吗 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没空听你演讲 小科
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.01,0:36:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道这是什么吗 - 这是曲速核
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.93,0:36:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是无可避免的放射性灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.18,0:36:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射一个或几十个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.06,0:36:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀伤力未知的鱼雷所造成的磁性输出变化
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.10,0:36:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕很小
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.69,0:36:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会引发连锁反应
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.61,0:36:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死这艘星舰上的所有生命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.94,0:36:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是让那些鱼雷上进取号
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.60,0:36:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就忍无可忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.53,0:36:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还有别的东西要忍吗 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.49,0:36:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要忍的东西多的是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.32,0:36:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括星际舰队没收了我的超曲速方程
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.04,0:36:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有个疯子用它横穿银河系
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.45,0:36:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他是从哪得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.54,0:36:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有我们的任务 小科
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.04,0:36:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是我担心的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.21,0:36:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这显然是一次军事行动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.88,0:36:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们该干的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.51,0:36:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们是负责探索的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.34,0:37:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,签署批准鱼雷登舰 这是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.26,0:37:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.05,0:37:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能辞职了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.51,0:37:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 小科
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.14,0:37:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我别无选择 长官 我不会同意
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.85,0:37:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没给我什么选择
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.06,0:37:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能破个例
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.35,0:37:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底批不批准我的辞职
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.81,0:37:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,批准
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.28,0:37:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我批准
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.87,0:37:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离职了 斯科特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.71,0:37:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 看在上帝份上 别用那些鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.89,0:37:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 曲速核反物质密封检查
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.11,0:38:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,将在3分钟后开始
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.32,0:38:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 派克上将的事我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.16,0:38:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 没事 谢谢你上尉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.59,0:38:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 小科刚辞职了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.17,0:38:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你男友不放过任何机会指责我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.35,0:38:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我失言了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.10,0:38:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我真想把他的刘海扯下来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.19,0:38:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能是我…- 不关你事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.90,0:38:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.61,0:38:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你们两个吵架了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.78,0:38:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想谈这个 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.86,0:38:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你们两个居然会吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.54,0:38:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你耳朵烫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.91,0:38:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长到达舰桥
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.54,0:38:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.54,0:39:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,切科夫先生 你一直在斯科特先生手下做事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.67,0:39:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你熟悉这艘星舰的工程系统吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.09,0:39:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟悉 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.22,0:39:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.80,0:39:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是我的新轮机长 穿上红色制服
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.27,0:39:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,收回所有系泊设备 苏鲁先生
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.77,0:39:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.36,0:39:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对接夹一二三号已释放
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.87,0:39:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有系泊设备已收回
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.17,0:39:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌胡拉上尉 打开全舰频道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.46,0:39:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.17,0:39:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,切科夫 星舰状态如何
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.17,0:39:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有系统正常 舰长 - 收到
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.47,0:39:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时可以开始曲速飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.05,0:39:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 切科夫先生
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.60,0:39:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 出发 - 遵命 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.57,0:40:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,频道已开启 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.03,0:40:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 进取号的全体成员
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.58,0:40:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大多已经知道 克里斯托弗·派克
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.75,0:40:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘星舰的前舰长 我们的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.37,0:40:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.84,0:40:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死他的人逃离了我们的管辖区域
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.59,0:40:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现藏身于克林贡人的母星
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.55,0:40:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为我们不会去那里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.47,0:40:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们现在正在路上
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.18,0:40:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯上将有命
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.63,0:40:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得被敌人发现我们的踪迹
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.14,0:40:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦和克林贡帝国的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.85,0:40:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,高度紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.64,0:40:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何挑衅行为都可能导致全面战争
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.74,0:40:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将亲自率领部队
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.79,0:41:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,登陆克隆那斯的一座废弃城市
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.17,0:41:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将在那里俘获逃犯约翰·哈里森
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.63,0:41:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将他带回地球 接受审判
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.97,0:41:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去抓这个畜生吧 柯克发言结束
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.14,0:41:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我觉得你的决定是正确的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.65,0:41:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能帮得上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.86,0:41:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意陪你去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.61,0:41:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.70,0:41:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是试图用你们的语言来表达
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.53,0:41:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.92,0:41:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体人员请注意 储藏舱门即将关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.81,0:42:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生 你吓到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.93,0:42:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么 博士
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.56,0:42:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 检验鱼雷内部 - 你误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.60,0:42:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问的是 你来这艘星舰做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.69,0:42:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有记录显示你被派遣到进取号
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.69,0:42:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 肯定哪里搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.11,0:42:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是这样想的 马科斯博士
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.28,0:42:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你撒谎隐瞒了身份
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.20,0:42:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,华莱士是你母亲的姓氏
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.66,0:42:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能假设上将是你的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.25,0:42:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.21,0:42:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我没资格向你提要求
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.88,0:42:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是求你了 不能让他知道我在这
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.72,0:42:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲速飞行被工程部人工关闭 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.98,0:42:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,切科夫先生 是你把星舰弄坏了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.81,0:42:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 长官 我不知道怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.52,0:42:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,内核过热
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.73,0:42:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不紧急停止
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.48,0:42:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是冷却剂泄漏了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.23,0:42:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一时半会找不到泄漏点
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.23,0:42:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 舰长 - 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.90,0:42:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 还有多久到达目的地
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.24,0:42:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,20分钟 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.49,0:43:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将在敌人领空飞行 而且毫无准备
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.70,0:43:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们得抓紧时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.45,0:43:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯波克呢 - 在这 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.08,0:43:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我一起去克隆那斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.08,0:43:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 你克林贡语水平如何
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.25,0:43:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些生疏 但是没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.29,0:43:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你也一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.71,0:43:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个一起工作
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.83,0:43:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.09,0:43:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.38,0:43:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.26,0:43:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿梭机舱见
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.60,0:43:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 你不会是真要下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.10,0:43:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,车都爆胎了还怎么抢银行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.90,0:43:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信等我们回来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.44,0:43:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,工程部会把动力装置修好的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.69,0:43:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 切科夫先生
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.73,0:43:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.11,0:43:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.24,0:43:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 你来操舵
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.70,0:43:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一出发 你就对准
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.45,0:43:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈里森的位置发射通讯信号
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.79,0:43:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他有一堆杀伤力极强的鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.12,0:43:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,正瞄着他的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.41,0:43:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不就范 你就会发射鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.38,0:43:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有问题吗 - 没有 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.34,0:43:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我从没坐过舰长椅
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.34,0:43:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会做得很好的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.51,0:44:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.14,0:44:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚让他参加了一场高风险的赌博
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.76,0:44:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,手里没好牌 还要他虚张声势
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.02,0:44:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁确实很出色 但他不是当舰长的料
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.56,0:44:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的两个小时 他就是舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.77,0:44:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再打比方了好吗 这是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.94,0:44:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.48,0:44:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那艘克诺米安的飞船做好飞行准备
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.16,0:44:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,代理舰长苏鲁呼叫2号穿梭机舱
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.49,0:44:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把我们上个月没收的商用飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.45,0:44:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,加满燃料 并做好飞行准备
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.21,0:44:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯克舰长正在前往
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.63,0:44:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就绪 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.38,0:44:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉们 请脱掉红衬衫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.47,0:44:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在是克诺米安军火商 穿上这个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.68,0:44:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 如果情况不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.22,0:44:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不能和星际舰队扯上干系
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.22,0:44:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想引发战争 亨多夫先生
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.81,0:44:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不想 长官 - 不想 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.35,0:44:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我也不想
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.37,0:45:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,检测到凯萨区有一个生命迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.17,0:45:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据斯科特提供的信息来看
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.33,0:45:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很可能就是约翰·哈里森
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.84,0:45:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁 我想我们找到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.46,0:45:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我们不是开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.80,0:45:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.84,0:45:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 约翰·哈里森
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.05,0:45:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是联邦星舰进取号舰长苏鲁田光
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.06,0:45:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,几位训练有素的军官正在驾驶穿梭机
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.54,0:45:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞向你的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.39,0:45:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不立即向他们投降
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.06,0:45:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会将本舰上
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.17,0:45:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有高级远程鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.32,0:45:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你发射
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.95,0:45:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有两分钟时间投降
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.03,0:45:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你将粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.04,0:45:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别试探我 那是自取灭亡
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.71,0:45:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.55,0:46:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不敢惹你了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.59,0:46:06.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克隆那斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.93,0:46:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将在三分钟后
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.68,0:46:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达哈里森的位置 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.27,0:46:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不太可能会主动投降
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.85,0:46:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我计算出他会试图杀掉我们的概率是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.27,0:46:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,91.6%
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.73,0:46:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.36,0:46:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好你不怕死
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 上尉 我没听清你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.49,0:46:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.91,0:46:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 你要是肯听
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.99,0:46:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我倒是很乐意说 - 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.16,0:46:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 我们最好私下谈
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.91,0:46:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不想谈
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.37,0:46:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们目前的状况
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.45,0:46:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非要现在说这些吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.96,0:46:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唯一没有专注的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.54,0:46:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 舰长 就一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.21,0:46:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 就是我们的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.50,0:46:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在火山那里 你完全没考虑我们的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.05,0:46:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了我怎么办 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.47,0:46:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太无情了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.30,0:46:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.80,0:46:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止我感到生气
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.00,0:46:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长也是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.10,0:46:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 没 别把我扯进来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.98,0:46:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.31,0:47:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我不在乎生死 这不正确
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.44,0:47:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意识的生物若要最大程度发挥自身作用
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.19,0:47:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,最佳选择是长久而富足的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.36,0:47:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.57,0:47:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不太像情话 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.24,0:47:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误解了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.78,0:47:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在意识到自己命不久矣时
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.91,0:47:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实选择了摒弃感情
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.96,0:47:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,派克上将临终前
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.25,0:47:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连通了他的意识
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.46,0:47:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,体会到了他临终时的情感
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.96,0:47:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,愤怒 困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.38,0:47:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.64,0:47:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.39,0:47:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾体会过这些
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.97,0:47:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我的星球被摧毁的那天
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.48,0:47:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些情感变得极度强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.98,0:47:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的情感
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.69,0:47:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不想再体会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.40,0:47:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼欧塔 你误以为我选择摒弃感情
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.16,0:47:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.49,0:47:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 事实恰恰相反
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.50,0:48:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.42,0:48:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 他们的信号呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.84,0:48:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,中断了 我正在重新连接
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.35,0:48:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正被一艘D- 4级克林贡飞船追击
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.56,0:48:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不是废墟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.64,0:48:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是碰巧遇到巡逻
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.93,0:48:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.11,0:48:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这艘船没有任何攻击能力
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.27,0:48:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我们呢 启动全部6块燃料电池
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.23,0:48:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.67,0:48:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.50,0:48:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在迅速逼进 方位285
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.34,0:48:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里 我们可以在那里甩掉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.34,0:48:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想通过前方建筑物间的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.30,0:48:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条缝隙
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.56,0:48:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们过不去的 - 能过去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.52,0:48:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我们过不去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.91,0:49:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,能过去 能过去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.08,0:49:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说了我们能过去 - 这种过法不算
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.96,0:49:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还看得见他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.21,0:49:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 这正是我担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.05,0:49:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甩掉他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.92,0:49:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是扫描器被干扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.21,0:49:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,更也许是甩掉他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.19,0:49:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们命令我们着陆
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.53,0:49:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 他们会想知道我们来这里的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.86,0:49:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会折磨我们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.16,0:49:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,审问我们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.87,0:50:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后杀掉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.54,0:50:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们出去跟他们拼了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.54,0:50:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们寡不敌众 火力又不够
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.71,0:50:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果先动手 肯定会死
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.80,0:50:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我来是因为我会克林贡语
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.30,0:50:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我去和他们谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.44,0:51:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一合乎逻辑的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.65,0:51:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你现在阻止她
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.75,0:51:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅会激怒克林贡人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.70,0:51:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会激怒乌胡拉上尉
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.46,0:51:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮助你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.40,0:51:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上尉 - 谢谢 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.62,0:52:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无意冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.99,0:52:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个罪犯藏在这片废墟中
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.08,0:52:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了很多人类
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.68,0:52:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要在乎一个人类杀人犯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.98,0:52:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你在乎荣誉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.86,0:52:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个人毫无荣誉可言
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.73,0:52:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的人也有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.05,0:55:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下武器 - 有几枚鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.51,0:55:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.17,0:55:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在通讯中
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.33,0:55:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来威胁我的那些鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.22,0:55:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.56,0:55:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,72枚
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.52,0:55:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投降
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.79,0:55:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表克里斯托弗·派克
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.33,0:55:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.29,0:55:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受你的投降
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.49,0:56:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.41,0:56:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.68,0:56:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他戴上手铐
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.91,0:56:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老骨头 在禁闭室那里等我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.44,0:56:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就到
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.70,0:56:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.45,0:56:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系星际舰队
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.62,0:56:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们我们抓到了哈里森
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.21,0:57:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等曲速核修好了我们就马上回去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.63,0:57:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.39,0:57:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到底为什么会投降 - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.73,0:57:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他凭一己之力解决了一队克林贡人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.56,0:57:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道他是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.73,0:57:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们抓了一个超人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.19,0:57:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点没错
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.20,0:57:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,胳膊伸出来 我要提取血样
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.26,0:57:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么还没走 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.60,0:58:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲速核发生了什么意外故障
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.81,0:58:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰好使你们在克林贡领空边缘搁浅了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.81,0:58:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道 - 老骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.48,0:58:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会发现我洞察力很可贵 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.61,0:58:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抽好了吗 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.66,0:58:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现要告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.91,0:58:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,忽视我就是将船上的所有人置身死地
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.75,0:58:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我觉得他只是想摆布你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.51,0:58:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议不要与他继续交谈
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.80,0:58:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.69,0:58:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你现在的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.36,0:58:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.49,0:58:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼目睹你杀了无辜的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.90,0:58:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,上头给我的命令是消灭你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.87,0:59:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然活着的唯一原因
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.24,0:59:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我允许你活着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.20,0:59:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.37,0:59:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 你是想再打我一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.88,0:59:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直打到胳膊酸为止吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.88,0:59:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显你想 那么你说
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.30,0:59:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你还允许我活着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.09,0:59:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会犯错
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.35,0:59:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我之所以投降
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.06,0:59:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为 虽然你想告诉我你心狠手辣
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.14,0:59:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你貌似有良心 柯克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.56,0:59:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有 你也就不会
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.82,0:59:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我所说的真相
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.90,0:59:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,23-17-46-11
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.78,0:59:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是地球附近的坐标点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.24,0:59:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想知道我为什么做了这些
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就去那里看看
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.58,0:59:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个让我相信你的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.34,0:59:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你72个理由
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.75,0:59:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们都在船上 舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.42,0:59:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都在船上
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.47,1:00:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你打开一个看看
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.83,1:00:08.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（旧金山港）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.83,1:00:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我真正纠结的是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.25,1:00:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那些修正 改进什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.59,1:00:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就这样被赶下星舰了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.09,1:00:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为坚持要做正确的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.84,1:00:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时为什么一声不吭
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.55,1:00:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是像个傻逼似的站在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.80,1:00:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.14,1:00:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.31,1:00:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科 我是柯克
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.93,1:00:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得正是时候
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.52,1:00:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是詹姆斯大帝舰长衰锅吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.60,1:00:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 我叫他衰锅
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.52,1:00:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪 - 你在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.02,1:00:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝醉了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.53,1:00:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的时间我做主 小吉吉
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.45,1:00:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事要你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.86,1:01:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能记下这个坐标吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.28,1:01:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,23-17-46-11
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.99,1:01:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,写下来了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.12,1:01:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我连四个数都记不住吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.29,1:01:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太小瞧我了 第三个数是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.88,1:01:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,４６
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.05,1:01:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你该去找什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.30,1:01:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我有预感 你看到就知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.47,1:01:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于这些鱼雷 也许你是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.47,1:01:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把这当成道歉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.81,1:01:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会考虑接受你的道歉的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.89,1:01:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你主动辞职的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.40,1:01:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逼我辞职的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.36,1:01:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特先生
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.65,1:01:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.99,1:01:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙脸皮真厚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.20,1:01:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不帮他呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.41,1:01:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不帮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.49,1:01:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.91,1:01:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子进水了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真的要相信那家伙吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.87,1:01:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了派克 还差点杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.88,1:01:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你竟然想撬开鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.21,1:01:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他让你撬
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.46,1:02:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要救我们 老骨头
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.38,1:02:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生说的有道理 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.13,1:02:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别赞同我 斯波克 这让我很不自在
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.64,1:02:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你也该学着控制情绪了 医生
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.64,1:02:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的情形下 根据逻辑
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.02,1:02:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,逻辑 天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.14,1:02:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个疯子想让我们炸毁自己的星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.89,1:02:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的 我不知道他为什么会投降
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.73,1:02:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但肯定不是为了炸掉星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.23,1:02:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须打开鱼雷 问题是怎么打开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.65,1:02:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 吉姆 斯科特先生不在船上
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.32,1:02:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁还有能力
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.82,1:02:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去撬开一个四吨重的炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.11,1:02:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上将的女儿似乎对那些鱼雷感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.82,1:02:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她是武器专家
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.41,1:02:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她可以
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.58,1:02:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么上将的女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.37,1:02:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔·马科斯 你的新科学专员
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.79,1:02:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为了上船而隐瞒了身份
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.25,1:02:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算什么时候告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.38,1:02:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,必要的时候 就像现在
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.59,1:02:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼雷在武器舱吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.22,1:02:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,已装载 随时可发射 它们是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.01,1:02:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 所以我伪造了调任令
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.43,1:02:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,上船来一探究竟
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.76,1:02:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.60,1:02:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果对你造成了什么麻烦 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.43,1:02:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫卡罗尔·马科斯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.06,1:02:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯·柯克 - 鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.94,1:02:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲准许我查看他监管的所有项目
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.19,1:03:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我听说他在开发这些鱼雷样品
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.94,1:03:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去和他探讨此事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.99,1:03:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至都不见我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.61,1:03:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那个时候 我发现这些鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.78,1:03:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从官方记录中消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.29,1:03:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他把它们给了我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.08,1:03:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比传说中聪明得多 柯克舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.29,1:03:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还小有名气吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.92,1:03:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 克莉丝汀·查普尔是我朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.63,1:03:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝汀啊 她好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.13,1:03:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被调到外边界当护士去了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.26,1:03:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在比以前开心多了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.38,1:03:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.63,1:03:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道我在说谁吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.80,1:03:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这里干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.89,1:03:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这架穿梭机随时可以起飞吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.97,1:03:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.39,1:03:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能转过身去吗 - 为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.98,1:03:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过去就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.56,1:03:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在进取号上尝试打开鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.65,1:03:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在是太危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这附近有个小行星
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.49,1:03:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以在那里打开
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.20,1:03:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.49,1:03:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.08,1:03:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.83,1:03:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长到达舰桥
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.58,1:03:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.12,1:03:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯博士和麦科伊医生到小行星了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.67,1:04:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.43,1:04:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在把鱼雷移到指定位置
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.67,1:04:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 有克林贡人的活动迹象吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.71,1:04:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前没有
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.17,1:04:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果我们在这儿耽搁太久
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.34,1:04:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一定会被他们发现
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.09,1:04:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌胡拉上尉 你是否已经通知星际舰队
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.85,1:04:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到了哈里森
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.51,1:04:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 目前没有回应
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.52,1:04:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,工程部呼叫舰桥
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.35,1:04:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 舰长 能听到我说话吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.69,1:04:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,切科夫先生 说点好消息
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.77,1:04:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到泄漏点了 长官 但损伤很大
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.11,1:04:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在抢修
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.28,1:04:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道是什么原因造成的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.61,1:04:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 长官 不过我会负全责
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.70,1:04:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,直觉告诉我这不是你的错 继续工作吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.79,1:04:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,与穿梭机的通讯已连接 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.38,1:04:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,老骨头 谢谢你的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.21,1:04:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯博士想要船上手最稳的人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.59,1:04:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我幻想和一个美女一起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.13,1:04:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,被困在一个荒芜的星球上的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.22,1:04:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没幻想那里有鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.72,1:04:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦科伊医生 给你提个醒
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.32,1:04:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是去那里泡妞的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.47,1:04:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这双传说之手该怎么帮你 马科斯博士
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.10,1:04:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,老骨头
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.22,1:04:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要了解这些武器的威力
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.23,1:04:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要打开弹头
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.39,1:05:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要打开弹头 我们就要进入燃料舱
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.06,1:05:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不幸的是
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.19,1:05:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些武器的弹头已经被激活了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.90,1:05:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 我曾经给怀孕的葛恩人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.94,1:05:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过一次紧急剖腹产手术
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.40,1:05:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,八胞胎
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.53,1:05:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 那些小畜生会咬人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.82,1:05:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我可以给你的导弹施加点魔力
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.58,1:05:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦科伊医生 有一束光纤电缆
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.54,1:05:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵住了内套管
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.04,1:05:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要切断第23根线
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.08,1:05:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 都不要碰到其它东西
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.92,1:05:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 我想也没想过
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.09,1:05:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦科伊医生
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.30,1:05:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我指令
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在将引爆处理器改道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.43,1:05:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗 - 等不及了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.55,1:05:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.56,1:05:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 鱼雷自我启动了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.43,1:05:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹头将在30秒后引爆 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.06,1:05:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 我胳膊卡住了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.73,1:05:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定他们的信号 马上把他们传送回来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.27,1:05:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送装置区别不了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.73,1:05:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦科伊医生和鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.07,1:05:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能两个一起传送回来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.86,1:05:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯博士 你能否将它关闭
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.57,1:05:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想办法 我在想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.32,1:05:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 快让她离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.45,1:05:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 如果把我送回去 他就死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.24,1:05:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我拆吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.08,1:05:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,十 九
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.91,1:06:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,八
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.12,1:06:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备传送马科斯博士
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.56,1:06:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请随时下令 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.46,1:06:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.67,1:06:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.51,1:06:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功解除激活 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.14,1:06:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦科伊医生 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.98,1:06:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,老骨头
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.31,1:06:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.40,1:06:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定对这个感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.53,1:06:42.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（坐标23.17.46.11 木星）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.13,1:07:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,D队
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.07,1:07:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的推进器运到12号装货码头
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.39,1:07:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是联邦星舰复仇号的舰桥人员
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.22,1:07:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求进入建设机库
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.02,1:07:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,准许进入机库
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.24,1:07:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号机舱需要一个焊接小组
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.08,1:08:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.58,1:08:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.71,1:08:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,设计者很聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.75,1:08:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把燃料箱从鱼雷中移除
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.00,1:08:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,并改装用于隐藏这个冷冻管
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.51,1:08:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还活着吗 - 还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.93,1:08:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我们尝试去唤醒他
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.59,1:08:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没有按照正确的步骤 反而会害死他
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.93,1:08:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂这项技术
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.02,1:08:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多先进 医生
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.60,1:08:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是先进 那个冷冻管很古老了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.69,1:08:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我们发明了曲速飞行
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.83,1:08:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不需要把人冷冻了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.69,1:08:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好解释了这位朋友最有意思的一点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.03,1:08:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有300岁了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.25,1:08:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么鱼雷里会有个人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.96,1:08:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的鱼雷里都有人 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.38,1:08:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我把他们放进去的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.26,1:08:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.43,1:09:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史的遗迹
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.27,1:09:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过基因改造变得强大
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.31,1:09:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好引导其他人从战争走向和平
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.44,1:09:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们被裁定为罪犯 被流放
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.65,1:09:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们沉睡了数个世纪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.61,1:09:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,期待醒来后 一切都会改变
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.66,1:09:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是瓦肯星毁灭带来的结果是
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.12,1:09:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们星际舰队开始积极地探索
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.33,1:09:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,浩瀚遥远的宇宙空间
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.67,1:09:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船被发现时正在太空中飘荡
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.26,1:09:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅我一人被唤醒了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.50,1:09:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查过约翰·哈里森
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.50,1:09:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年之前 他还不存在
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.92,1:09:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的马科斯上将为了他的事业将我唤醒
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.51,1:09:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·哈里森这个假身份始于那个时候
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.01,1:09:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是用来隐藏我真实身份的障眼法
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.64,1:09:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真名叫
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.77,1:09:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.11,1:10:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么一个星际舰队的上将
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.11,1:10:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,会求助于一个被冰冻的300岁的人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.91,1:10:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我更出色
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.79,1:10:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪方面 - 所有方面
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.62,1:10:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山大·马科斯需要在文明时代
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.71,1:10:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个野蛮的威胁作出回应
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.88,1:10:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此他需要一颗战士的头脑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.38,1:10:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头脑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.88,1:10:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来设计武器和战舰
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.13,1:10:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.22,1:10:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上将违反了所有他发誓要遵守的规定
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.18,1:10:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他想借用你的智慧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.43,1:10:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想借用我的野性
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.89,1:10:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗光靠智慧是不够的 斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.69,1:10:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你连规矩都不敢打破
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.52,1:10:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎么杀得了人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.15,1:10:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯利用我制造武器
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.99,1:10:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助他实现建造军事化舰队的愿望
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.91,1:10:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让你使用那些武器
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.03,1:10:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的鱼雷发射到一个毫无戒心的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.71,1:10:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他故意在敌方地盘弄坏你的船
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.58,1:10:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而导致一个不可避免的结果
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.55,1:11:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林贡人会去寻找
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.21,1:11:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁发射了鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.09,1:11:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你只能束手待毙
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.39,1:11:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终马科斯所说的战争就会发生
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.89,1:11:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他一直想要的战争
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.06,1:11:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.73,1:11:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼见你朝着一屋子
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.02,1:11:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,手无寸铁的星际舰队军官开火
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.77,1:11:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冷血地杀害了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.61,1:11:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯夺走了我的船员
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.28,1:11:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个杀人凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.53,1:11:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他利用我的朋友来控制我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.41,1:11:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想偷偷地把他们运到安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.12,1:11:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他们藏在了我设计的武器当中
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.42,1:11:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是被发现了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.76,1:11:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有办法 只能自己逃走
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.93,1:11:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃走后 我只能相信
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.14,1:11:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯杀了每一个
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.56,1:12:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最最在乎的人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.11,1:12:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我以牙还牙
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.62,1:12:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船员
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.29,1:12:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我的家人 柯克
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.16,1:12:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意为你的家人赴汤蹈火吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.25,1:12:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有物体接近 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.51,1:12:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘曲速飞行中的星舰正迎面向我们驶来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.34,1:12:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是克林贡人吗 - 曲速飞行中？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.47,1:12:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 柯克
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.84,1:12:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都知道是谁 - 不是他们
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.18,1:12:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是从克隆那斯飞过来的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.31,1:12:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 带可汗去医务舱
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.60,1:12:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,派六名警卫看着他
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.98,1:12:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.36,1:12:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长到达舰桥
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.53,1:12:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该星舰的预计到达时间
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.19,1:12:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,三秒 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.36,1:12:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开启防护盾 - 是 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.72,1:13:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在呼叫我们 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.23,1:13:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,接到大屏幕
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.56,1:13:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,全舰播放 以供记录在案
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.90,1:13:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯克舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.65,1:13:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯上将 没想到是您
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.24,1:13:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的船真是帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.24,1:13:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没想到会接到消息说
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.49,1:13:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违抗命令
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.25,1:13:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,将哈里森拘捕了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.71,1:13:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.42,1:13:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的曲速核发生了意外故障
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.50,1:13:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得随机应变
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.55,1:13:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但您已经知道了 不是吗 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.67,1:13:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂你的意思
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.18,1:13:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,您来这里不就是因为这个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.76,1:13:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们修理星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.55,1:13:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则还有什么理由会让
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.26,1:13:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际战队的首领亲自来到中立区的边缘
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.60,1:14:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 他们在扫描我们的船
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.44,1:14:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我帮您找什么吗 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.40,1:14:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的囚犯在哪 柯克
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.11,1:14:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照星际舰队的规定
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.48,1:14:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算将可汗带回地球受审
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.74,1:14:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.41,1:14:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他说过话
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.12,1:14:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是我不希望你蹚的浑水
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.87,1:14:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冒着风险唤醒了那个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.63,1:14:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信他卓越的才智
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.25,1:14:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以保护我们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.79,1:14:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论敌人是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.88,1:14:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.72,1:14:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他杀了这么多人 我难辞其咎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.97,1:14:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我请求你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.14,1:14:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.98,1:14:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我收拾好自己的烂摊子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.07,1:14:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我怎么处理
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.82,1:14:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他剩下的船员 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.24,1:14:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们发射给克林贡人 结束72条性命
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.95,1:14:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便挑起一场战争吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.62,1:15:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他把那些人放进鱼雷里的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.58,1:15:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想增加你的负担
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.16,1:15:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,才没让你知道里面是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.50,1:15:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也见到了这家伙单打独斗的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.50,1:15:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是把其他船员唤醒
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.94,1:15:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想象会发生什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.01,1:15:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还跟你说了什么 说他是维和部队吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.59,1:15:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在耍你 孩子 你看不出来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.55,1:15:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗和他的船员是战犯 已被判处死刑
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.52,1:15:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们有责任在他杀害更多人之前
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.68,1:15:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们处死
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.69,1:15:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我再问你一遍
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.86,1:15:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一遍 孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.86,1:15:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你们的防护盾
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.03,1:15:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.70,1:15:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在工程部 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.29,1:15:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会马上把他
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.79,1:15:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,带到传送室去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.96,1:15:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的就交给我了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.55,1:15:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要放下防护盾
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.63,1:15:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏鲁先生 - 是 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.72,1:15:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 鉴于你知道
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.80,1:15:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗的真实位置在医务舱
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.38,1:15:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能知道你计划的细节吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.14,1:16:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉马科斯我们要把逃犯带回地球
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.14,1:16:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们要做的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.10,1:16:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,切科夫先生 我们能曲速飞行吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.64,1:16:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 如果我们曲速飞行
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.35,1:16:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲速核心会严重损害的风险很大
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.56,1:16:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能飞
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.73,1:16:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,从技术层面上讲是可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.28,1:16:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不建议这么做 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.74,1:16:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.74,1:16:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 设定去地球的航线
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.99,1:16:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.20,1:16:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.54,1:16:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,最起码我们又在移动了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.22,1:16:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们觉得在曲速域是安全的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.84,1:16:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就错了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.76,1:16:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌胡拉上尉 联系星际舰队
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.43,1:16:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我们被一艘无标记的联邦星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.06,1:16:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,追赶到了中立区
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.77,1:16:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯系统失灵了 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.36,1:16:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求进入舰桥
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.52,1:16:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯博士
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.28,1:16:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会赶上我们的 当他赶上了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.69,1:16:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我可以让他不摧毁这艘船
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.61,1:16:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你得让我和他谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.61,1:17:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔 我们在曲速域 他追不上我们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.53,1:17:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他可以 他一直在研究一种
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.91,1:17:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有高级曲速飞行能力的星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.28,1:17:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 仪表的读数让我很不解
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.82,1:17:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.90,1:17:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,离地球237000公里处
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.15,1:17:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 损坏报告 - 武器已失灵
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.28,1:17:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护盾快撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.91,1:17:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已无防御能力 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.74,1:17:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 有个舱壁缺口了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.12,1:17:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 缺口在哪里 - 主船体 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.62,1:17:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,规避战术 带我们去地球 快
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.17,1:17:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 停下 如果你不让我和他谈
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.46,1:17:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这船上的每个人都会死
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.17,1:18:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌胡拉 呼叫他
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.63,1:18:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 是我 卡罗尔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.61,1:18:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那艘船上做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.44,1:18:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你说的了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.78,1:18:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你犯下了错误
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.03,1:18:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正尽全力去弥补它
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.62,1:18:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.33,1:18:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信抚养我长大的人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.12,1:18:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,会摧毁一艘满载无辜的人的星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.00,1:18:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.80,1:18:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那您就连我一起杀了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.30,1:18:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 卡罗尔 我不会那么做的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.98,1:18:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉姆 - 我们能中断传送信号吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.56,1:18:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.86,1:18:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.48,1:19:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯克舰长 你未经授权
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.44,1:19:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,与逃犯约翰·哈里森为伍
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.66,1:19:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,肆意进入敌人的领地
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.62,1:19:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不追捕你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.74,1:19:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,并摧毁你的星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.99,1:19:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,相位炮准备
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.67,1:19:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 长官 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.41,1:19:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会速度解决你们
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.50,1:19:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有舰尾鱼雷瞄准进取号舰桥
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.00,1:19:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我的船员都只是听命于我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.42,1:19:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对我的行为负全责
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.05,1:19:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切后果 只由我一个人承担
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.09,1:19:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就将可汗的位置发送给您
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.26,1:19:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只请求您能放过他们
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.44,1:19:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,求您了 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.11,1:19:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我任您处置
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.69,1:19:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们留条生路
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.03,1:19:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是感人的道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.70,1:19:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你也不必太内疚
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.87,1:19:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我根本没打算放过你的船员
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.96,1:19:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开火
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.73,1:20:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对不起大家
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.24,1:20:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的武器无法开火 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.49,1:20:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的防护盾关闭了 能量不足
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.82,1:20:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在工程部手动重置了我们的系统
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.32,1:20:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,「有人」是什么意思 是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.70,1:20:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的武器没电了 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.41,1:20:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,进取号 能听到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.79,1:20:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.00,1:20:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜我在木星后面发现了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.13,1:20:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在那艘船上 - 我溜上来的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.13,1:20:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于我刚刚犯下了背叛
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.59,1:20:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队上将的大罪
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.26,1:20:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我巴不得早点离开这艘该死的船
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.51,1:20:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把我传送回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.59,1:20:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.76,1:20:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在能量不太够
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.72,1:20:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在那儿待命 待命
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.85,1:20:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「能量不够」是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.14,1:20:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,进取号怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.06,1:20:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会打给你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.11,1:21:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.52,1:21:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 我们的星舰状况如何
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.36,1:21:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的选择有限 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.90,1:21:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们既不能开火也不能撤离
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.03,1:21:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个选择
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.41,1:21:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌胡拉 小科回电的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.25,1:21:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把信号转接给我 - 是的 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.25,1:21:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生 你来操舵
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.63,1:21:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我强烈反对
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.55,1:21:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,反对什么 我什么都还没说
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.46,1:21:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们无法从外部攻击那艘星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.13,1:21:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的办法就是从内部拿下
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.72,1:21:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而大规模人员登船会被发现
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.43,1:21:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以最理想的策略是
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.55,1:21:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,带领尽可能少的人员
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.39,1:21:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会遇到敌人 因此合适的人员
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.02,1:21:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要具备高超作战能力
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.14,1:21:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得对那艘船有足够的了解
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.23,1:21:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着你要和可汗 也就是
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.36,1:21:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们此行要消灭的人结盟
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.48,1:21:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要与他结盟 我是在利用他
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.19,1:21:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人的敌人就是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.24,1:21:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一句阿拉伯谚语 出自一个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.36,1:21:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,被自己的子民背叛并斩首的王子之口
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.16,1:21:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这句话很有用
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.41,1:21:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你一起去 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.42,1:21:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你要留在舰桥上
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.75,1:21:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不允许你这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.58,1:22:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在船上的职责就是给你建议
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.46,1:22:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你作出尽可能明智的决策
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.96,1:22:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我坚信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.13,1:22:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你此刻没有作出明智决策的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.75,1:22:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.51,1:22:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要做的事一点都不合理
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.42,1:22:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合逻辑 完全靠直觉
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.26,1:22:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我该做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.02,1:22:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我能做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.85,1:22:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,进取号和她的船员需要
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.56,1:22:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,头脑清醒的人来主持大局
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.86,1:22:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那个人不是我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.20,1:22:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.39,1:23:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你所知道的关于那艘星舰的一切
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.48,1:23:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,无畏级星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.31,1:23:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,两倍大小 三倍速度
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.06,1:23:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,配备先进武器 所需船员数量极少
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.98,1:23:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它与其他联邦星舰不同
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.23,1:23:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是专为战斗而设计的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.07,1:23:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会竭尽所能让你
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.99,1:23:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,为所犯下的罪行付出代价
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.50,1:23:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在我需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.25,1:23:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,用什么来交换
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.50,1:23:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过你愿意为了你的船员赴汤蹈火
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.34,1:23:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能确保他们的安全 - 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.01,1:23:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连自己船员的安全都无法保证
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.69,1:23:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老骨头 你为什么在鼓捣一只毛毛球
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.27,1:23:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只毛毛球已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.69,1:23:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在将可汗的血小板
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.09,1:23:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,注入到它已经坏死的组织中
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.19,1:23:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过像可汗细胞这样的再生能力
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.74,1:23:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.62,1:24:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底跟不跟我一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.46,1:24:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.29,1:24:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要过去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.01,1:24:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁正在将进取号开到理想位置
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.63,1:24:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,上这艘船吗 怎么上
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.34,1:24:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个货舱门
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.10,1:24:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在7号机库 101A号入口
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.80,1:24:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要找到手动阀来开启舱闸
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.97,1:24:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 你是谁来着
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.06,1:24:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,按他说的做 小科 没问题的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.02,1:24:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题才怪
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.48,1:24:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我在太空开启舱闸
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.35,1:24:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定得被冻死 然后粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.48,1:24:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 从我们现在的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.03,1:24:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否联络上新瓦肯星
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.65,1:24:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我尽量试试 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.91,1:24:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 另一艘星舰的情况怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.33,1:24:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的系统仍然处于离线状态
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.99,1:24:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在调整我们星舰的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.28,1:25:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科 那边情况如何
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.95,1:25:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我希望能有更好的消息
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.54,1:25:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这艘船的电脑的入口已经被关闭
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.79,1:25:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的武器3分钟后就会全部恢复正常
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.00,1:25:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着我无法再次阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.71,1:25:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁进取号了 待命
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.30,1:25:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 我们的垃圾排放口已经瞄准了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.38,1:25:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对方星舰的101A号入口
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.72,1:25:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 星舰已就位
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.59,1:25:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.64,1:25:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小科 - 我已经在机库了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.92,1:25:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点时间
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.06,1:25:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跑 待命
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.24,1:26:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.82,1:26:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个舱门太小了 就那么一丁点大
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.95,1:26:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多也就4平方米
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.12,1:26:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像想从在桥上飞奔的车里跳出去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.12,1:26:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后落到桥下的一个烈酒杯里一样
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.25,1:26:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 这事我干过
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.92,1:26:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我是垂直跳下去的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.09,1:26:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跳到了一个 一个
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.09,1:26:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不重要 小科
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.34,1:26:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到手动阀了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.63,1:26:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,手动阀 小科
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.18,1:26:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没 还没
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.44,1:26:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 请你在出发前意识到
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.19,1:26:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,两艘星舰之间会有相当多的残骸
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.19,1:26:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 别说了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.99,1:26:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科 你那边好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.11,1:26:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么容易
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.86,1:26:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别催我行吗 你这个疯子
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.79,1:26:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说这一定会成功
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.96,1:26:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既没有真凭实据
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.46,1:26:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有信心向你保证 医生
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.46,1:26:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 马上搞定
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.13,1:26:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真会安慰人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.96,1:27:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.09,1:27:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.26,1:27:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 我随时可以把门打开
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.89,1:27:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.22,1:27:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.81,1:27:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 把我们弹出去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.40,1:27:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.15,1:27:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,运行激活程序倒计时
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.07,1:27:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.53,1:27:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.41,1:27:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.67,1:27:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 柯克在0.432方向有障碍物
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.59,1:27:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 你正前方有残骸
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.42,1:27:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.43,1:27:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 你偏离轨道了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.01,1:27:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我看出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.73,1:28:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.53,1:28:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的可视指南针 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.11,1:28:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须精确调整
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.24,1:28:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 37.243度 - 知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.62,1:28:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在想办法重返轨道
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.62,1:28:11.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（偏离轨道）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.45,1:28:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科 你准备好开门了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.67,1:28:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.46,1:28:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在维修舱闸控制台 你块头真大
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.25,1:28:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特先生 你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.63,1:28:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 他好像听不到你说话
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.09,1:28:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在重获他的信号 待命
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.72,1:28:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 - 舰长 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.64,1:28:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头盔被击中了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.72,1:28:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌胡拉 联系上斯科特了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.56,1:28:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没 我还在搜索信号
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.06,1:28:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的通讯工具无故障
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.64,1:28:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他为什么不回答
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.91,1:28:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.86,1:28:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是星际舰队的还是私人保镖
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.40,1:28:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你另一只手
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.48,1:28:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来像私人保镖
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.65,1:28:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方有障碍
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.28,1:28:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗 注意躲避
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.36,1:28:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正前方有残骸 - 看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.50,1:28:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 与可汗失去联系了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.83,1:28:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 中校
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.59,1:28:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难在这些残骸中追踪到他
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.08,1:29:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗被击中了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.42,1:29:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在找他
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.00,1:29:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 你需要调整目标方向
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.67,1:29:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,至183/473度
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.35,1:29:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 我的显示屏坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.68,1:29:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,航线没了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.02,1:29:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 没有可视指南针
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.77,1:29:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要到达目标是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.94,1:29:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 如果我能回去
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.19,1:29:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须好好教教你该怎么说话
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.20,1:29:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 他到不了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.74,1:29:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的显示屏没坏
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.45,1:29:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你了 柯克
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.17,1:29:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我前方200米
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.21,1:29:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,1点钟方向处
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.50,1:29:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你往左调整几度 跟着我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.18,1:29:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科 我们马上就到了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.98,1:29:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要好好迎接我们啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.72,1:29:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了吗 收到了吗 小科
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.23,1:29:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果听到的话 斯科特先生
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.64,1:30:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请在倒计时结束前打开舱门 十 九
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.62,1:30:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.56,1:30:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人在倒计时
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.61,1:30:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 八
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.69,1:30:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定是幻听了 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.90,1:30:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七 - 斯科特先生 你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.78,1:30:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,六 五
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.62,1:30:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,1800米 1600米
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.03,1:30:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小科 你在哪儿 - 三
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.45,1:30:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了吗 小科 求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.87,1:30:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.37,1:30:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 什么对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.62,1:30:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯科特先生 快开门 - 开门
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.95,1:30:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特 快
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.77,1:30:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎登舰
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.10,1:30:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你真好 小科 - 他是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.78,1:30:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗 这是小科
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.55,1:30:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科 这是可汗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.69,1:30:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.61,1:30:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很快就会发现我们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.07,1:30:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道到达舰桥的最佳路线
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.87,1:30:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这枪设定在眩晕模式
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.79,1:31:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人可不会这么仁慈
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.37,1:31:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量别被击中
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.13,1:31:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 已经联系上新瓦肯星
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.30,1:31:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请在大屏幕上显示出来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.30,1:31:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.64,1:31:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.48,1:31:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.32,1:31:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上将
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.53,1:31:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会儿再处理你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.32,1:31:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为你的女儿我感到很羞耻
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.58,1:31:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 第13层的机库门
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.49,1:31:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚被打开过
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.67,1:31:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.09,1:31:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们马上就恢复电力了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.21,1:31:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们居然还用走的？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.42,1:31:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,高速电梯很容易被追踪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.67,1:31:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,被马科斯发现就死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.17,1:31:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路在轮机舱附近
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.51,1:31:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很清楚在这里使用武器
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.26,1:31:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,会影响到曲速核
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.60,1:31:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的优势
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.10,1:32:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这家伙你从哪儿找来的 - 说来话长
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.10,1:32:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我长话短说
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.19,1:32:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在旅程中
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.34,1:32:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有遇到过一个叫可汗的人
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.11,1:32:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.28,1:32:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发过誓 不会向你透露任何
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.70,1:32:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会改变你命运的信息
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.53,1:32:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己的路要你自己去走 没人能干涉
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.88,1:32:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.05,1:32:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可汗·努尼恩·辛格是进取号遇到过的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.30,1:32:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对手中最危险的一个
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.22,1:32:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他聪明过人 冷酷无情
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.31,1:32:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他视你们的性命
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.89,1:32:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为蝼蚁
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.56,1:32:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打败他了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.23,1:32:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不过付出了极大的代价
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.57,1:32:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何做到的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.70,1:33:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是活得不耐烦 但他们人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.83,1:33:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘星舰所需的船员极少
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.62,1:33:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果必要的话 一个人也行
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.75,1:33:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个就够了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.27,1:33:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 可汗在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.11,1:33:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 请你召集医疗部和工程部的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.53,1:33:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有高级人员到武器舱
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.86,1:33:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.53,1:33:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦科伊医生 你之前无意中启动过鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.79,1:33:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能重复这个过程吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.12,1:33:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.62,1:33:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,能还是不能
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.12,1:33:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 伙计 我是个医生
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.88,1:33:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是鱼雷技师
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.13,1:33:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为你是个医生
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.34,1:33:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你更应该仔细听清我说的活
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.46,1:33:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.30,1:34:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.97,1:34:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.14,1:34:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一到舰桥 就把他放倒
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.81,1:34:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要击晕可汗吗 我还以为他在帮我们
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.48,1:34:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很肯定是我们在帮他
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.41,1:34:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,电力恢复正常 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.91,1:34:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在重新瞄准进取号 - 是 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.35,1:34:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着他 别让他跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.77,1:34:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 借过 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.94,1:34:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯上将 你被捕了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.44,1:34:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真打算这样做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:35:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,上将 离开这椅子
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.20,1:35:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好想清楚自己在干什么 柯克
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.86,1:35:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你在克隆那斯都干了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.08,1:35:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你入侵了敌方的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.95,1:35:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还杀死了克林贡人的一支巡逻队
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.04,1:35:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你能全身而退 战争也在所难免
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.46,1:35:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来指挥 你吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.13,1:35:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没我指挥
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.76,1:35:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就彻底完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.13,1:35:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我离开这艘星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.97,1:35:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不如杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.47,1:35:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不打算杀你 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.39,1:35:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以把你电晕后从那椅子上拖下来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.31,1:35:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望在你女儿面前这样做
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.74,1:35:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 没事 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.28,1:35:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.59,1:36:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.10,1:36:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.60,1:36:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该让我沉睡下去
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.28,1:36:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长在哪 苏鲁先生
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.61,1:36:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的传感器阵列坏了 找不到他
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.70,1:36:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把话说得简单一些
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.87,1:36:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舰长 - 用我的船员换你的船员
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.62,1:36:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.29,1:36:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很聪明 斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.13,1:36:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 不要…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.96,1:36:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生 把我的船员还给我
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.97,1:36:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还你以后你打算怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.68,1:36:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续我们被流放前的任务
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.26,1:36:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,照我的理解
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.32,1:36:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这项任务包括灭绝所有
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.71,1:36:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为比你劣等的种族
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.31,1:36:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生 是要我消灭你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.64,1:36:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你乖乖地把我想要的交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.90,1:37:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有传送能力
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.86,1:37:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好我的星舰功能齐全
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.90,1:37:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下防护盾
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.49,1:37:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是照做的话
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.52,1:37:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,难保你不会消灭进取号
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.99,1:37:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生 我来帮你搞清楚状况
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.58,1:37:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我会杀了你们的舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.04,1:37:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以示我的决心
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.04,1:37:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们还是不合作 我就只好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.00,1:37:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉你和你的所有船员
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.71,1:37:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你毁了我们的船
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.47,1:37:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同伴也难逃一死
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.59,1:37:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的船员需要氧气活命 我的不需要
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.51,1:37:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会攻击你们位于舰尾
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.26,1:37:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎舱后的维生系统
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.64,1:37:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到你们船上每个人都窒息身亡
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.98,1:37:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再踏过你们冰冷的尸体去营救我的同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.03,1:37:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.20,1:37:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以开始了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.20,1:37:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下防护盾
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.46,1:38:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,明智的选择 斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.38,1:38:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到那72枚鱼雷还在冷冻管内
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.55,1:38:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你敢偷梁换柱 中校
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.24,1:38:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.14,1:38:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦肯人从不说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.23,1:38:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些鱼雷都是你的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.20,1:38:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 斯波克先生
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.20,1:38:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经满足了你的要求
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.87,1:38:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在换你了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.29,1:38:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯克 还是让你和你的船员团聚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.42,1:38:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.88,1:38:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长就该跟他的星舰一起命丧黄泉
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.80,1:38:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在用相位炮瞄准我们 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.48,1:39:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让我们出来
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.82,1:39:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护盾防御能力只剩6%
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.66,1:39:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼雷 还剩多少时间 上尉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.74,1:39:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,12秒 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.87,1:39:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,进取号的船员们
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.99,1:39:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,近距离爆炸冲击即将发生 请准备
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.91,1:39:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说什么 什么爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.83,1:39:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼雷 他启动了那些该死的鱼雷
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.13,1:39:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.43,1:39:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 他们的武器已被摧毁
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.10,1:39:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得好 中校 - 多谢 上尉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.56,1:39:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老骨头 - 老骨头
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.53,1:39:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 护士 - 来了 我来扶你
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.74,1:39:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯博士
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.45,1:39:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 吉姆
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.62,1:39:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮斯波克引爆了那些鱼雷吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.28,1:39:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点没错
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.37,1:39:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他居然杀了可汗的船员
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.95,1:40:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克是很冷血 但还不至于做这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.96,1:40:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗的船员在我这里
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.12,1:40:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,72条人体冰棍
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.50,1:40:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安然无恙地躺在冷冻管里
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.80,1:40:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小子
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.68,1:40:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 中心电力网不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.68,1:40:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 调用后备电源 - 后备电源也不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.48,1:40:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 星舰被地球的引力吸住了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.74,1:40:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能停下吗 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.08,1:40:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 不
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.08,1:40:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧疏散
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.92,1:40:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入紧急戒备状态 希望你不会晕船
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.00,1:40:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会吗 - 会
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.09,1:40:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 通知各个甲板的人员撤离
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.72,1:40:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.88,1:40:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以代理舰长的身份
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.03,1:40:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,命令你们弃舰
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.85,1:41:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会留下来 将所有能量
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.58,1:41:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供给维生系统和逃生穿梭机舱
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.43,1:41:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离方案…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.19,1:41:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你们弃船
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.81,1:41:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 中校 我们是不会走的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.95,1:41:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才离开这艘船一天 他妈才一天
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.08,1:41:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力系统正在失灵 撑住 撑住
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.00,1:41:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,各甲板请注意
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.75,1:41:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离方案现已生效
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.42,1:41:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,请前往出口 到指定的穿梭机处报到
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.38,1:41:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们没有足够能量稳住这艘船
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.76,1:41:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那根本就不够时间撤离
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.10,1:41:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以修好吗 - 只能在工程部修
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.77,1:41:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回到曲速核那里
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.10,1:41:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.40,1:41:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小科 我们得让星舰恢复动力
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.34,1:41:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.58,1:42:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小科 我们得跳过去 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.17,1:42:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳啊 跳啊
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.55,1:42:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.97,1:42:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,应急电源还剩15% 仍在降低
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.55,1:42:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,各甲板请注意
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.01,1:42:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离方案现已生效
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.56,1:42:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请前往出口 到指定的穿梭机处报到
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.57,1:42:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉姆 - 坚持住
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.32,1:42:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.22,1:43:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住你了 舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.89,1:43:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 切科夫 - 别放手
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.69,1:43:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使重启了曲速核
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.01,1:43:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要将能量重定向
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.49,1:43:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说得对 舰长 - 你们在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.20,1:43:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须有人去打开手动开关
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.36,1:43:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子 有个开关…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.66,1:43:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在碟形偏转器后边 我去扳开关
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.03,1:43:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.37,1:43:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.72,1:43:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离方案现已生效
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.55,1:43:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请前往出口 到指定的穿梭机处报到
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.14,1:43:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 把剩余电力都调去稳定器
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.10,1:43:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽我所能 长官 尽我所能
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.33,1:44:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,核心偏离 危险
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.42,1:44:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.17,1:44:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,底座的方向偏离了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.50,1:44:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法将能量重定向
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.50,1:44:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船死定了 长官 她没救了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.92,1:44:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 她还有救 - 等等 吉姆
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.97,1:44:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去的话会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.55,1:44:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见没 辐射会要了我们的命
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.85,1:44:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有在听吗 你他妈的在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.18,1:44:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在开门 我要进去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.44,1:44:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这扇门是用来防辐射的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.73,1:44:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没来得及爬上去我们就死了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.44,1:44:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你爬
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.94,1:44:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险 核心偏离
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.74,1:44:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险 核心偏离
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.68,1:45:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不能重获动力或者重启防护盾
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.72,1:45:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进入大气层时就会被烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.08,1:47:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲速核已恢复运作
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.37,1:47:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大推力 苏鲁先生
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.01,1:47:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大推力 准备 准备
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.79,1:47:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护盾已修复
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.30,1:47:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 动力已恢复
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.20,1:47:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克先生 正在稳定飞行高度
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.54,1:47:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.13,1:47:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有奇迹这回事
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.55,1:47:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,工程部呼叫舰桥
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.05,1:47:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯波克先生 - 斯科特先生
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.38,1:47:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你最好下来看看
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.39,1:47:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,越快越好
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.41,1:48:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.66,1:48:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,净化处理还没完成
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.50,1:48:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门的话 辐射会溢满整个舱
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.75,1:48:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,门锁住了 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.28,1:48:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的船怎样了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.12,1:48:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,已脱离危险
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.12,1:49:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了所有船员
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.79,1:49:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用他想要的东西来攻击他
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.63,1:49:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招真妙
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.13,1:49:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了你也会那样做
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.89,1:49:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.81,1:49:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招只有你想得出来
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.14,1:49:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠的是逻辑
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.65,1:49:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好害怕 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.07,1:49:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.25,1:49:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么摒弃自己的感情的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.34,1:49:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.68,1:50:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在做不到了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.44,1:50:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你知道 为什么我不能让你去死
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.69,1:50:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我回去救你
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.36,1:50:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.20,1:51:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.79,1:51:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 差点就撞上了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.46,1:51:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定目的地 星际舰队总部
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.84,1:52:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动机受损
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.17,1:52:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能保证到达目的地
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.30,1:52:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请确认命令
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.05,1:52:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.70,1:53:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,探测敌舰是否存在生命迹象
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.20,1:53:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 不可能有人活下来
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.42,1:53:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.29,1:53:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.16,1:53:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚往下跳了30米
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.91,1:53:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把他传送上来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.16,1:53:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,星舰受损太严重
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.29,1:53:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,收不到信号
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.83,1:53:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也许能将你传送下去 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.13,1:54:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓住他
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.51,1:54:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好坐标 - 是的 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.43,1:54:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入坐标（3517，2598）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.05,1:54:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐标已确认
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.95,1:55:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我搬一个冷冻管过来 快
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.59,1:56:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这人抬出冷冻管
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.26,1:56:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他保持诱导昏迷状态
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.67,1:56:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把柯克放进去
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.17,1:56:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一可能保住他大脑机能的方法
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.01,1:56:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗的血还剩多少
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.93,1:56:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.85,1:57:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,进取号呼叫斯波克 斯波克
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.74,1:58:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,运行冷冻程序
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.92,1:58:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦科伊呼叫舰桥
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.04,1:58:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我联系不上斯波克 要活捉可汗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.54,1:58:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上把那狗娘养的弄到船上
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.59,1:58:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该能救柯克
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.30,1:58:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把他们传送到船上吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.59,1:58:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不停在动 我一个都无法锁定
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.10,1:58:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,能传送其他人下去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.38,1:58:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.97,1:59:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.27,1:59:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 住手 快住手
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.69,1:59:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他能救柯克
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.66,1:59:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 男孩女孩？- 男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.33,1:59:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就叫吉姆吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.41,1:59:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲当过12分钟的星舰舰长
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.83,1:59:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了800人 你一定会做得更好
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.88,1:59:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太激动 你死不了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.01,1:59:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,输血的副作用真大
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.77,1:59:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经昏迷两周了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.85,1:59:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,输血？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.93,1:59:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的细胞受到严重辐射 我们别无他法
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.44,1:59:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可汗呢
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.77,1:59:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一抓到他
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.07,1:59:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就从他的超级血液中合成了一种血清
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.78,2:00:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你有没有想杀人的冲动
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.45,2:00:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者变得迷恋权力 暴戾
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.20,2:00:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很正常
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.28,2:00:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么抓住他的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.87,2:00:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我抓住他的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.04,2:00:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的命
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.84,2:00:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实乌胡拉和我也帮了忙
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.88,2:00:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 是你救了我和其他人…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.64,2:00:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克 少说两句吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.68,2:00:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.35,2:00:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气 吉姆
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.32,2:00:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要伤害我们的人一直存在
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.66,2:00:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.66,2:00:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不惜唤醒心中的恶魔
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.59,2:01:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们所爱之人被夺走时
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.26,2:01:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最初想到的会是报复
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.64,2:01:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们并不是这样的人
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.93,2:01:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天在此
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.73,2:01:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,举行联邦星舰进取号的重命名仪式
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.73,2:01:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,并向约一年前牺牲的英雄们致敬
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.69,2:01:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗·派克把他的星舰交给我的同时
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.95,2:01:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把舰长的誓词背下来
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.28,2:01:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我并不领会个中含义
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.79,2:01:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我觉得 它是在提醒我们
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.62,2:01:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要牢记历史
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.38,2:01:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,并再创辉煌
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.05,2:01:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,誓词是这样写的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.22,2:01:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙 人类最后的边疆
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.72,2:01:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些旅程属于星舰进取号
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.31,2:01:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的下一个五年任务
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.23,2:01:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是去探索未知的新世界
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.81,2:02:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找寻新的生命和新的文明
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.98,2:02:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢地航向前人所未至的领域
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.74,2:02:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长到达舰桥
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.75,2:02:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦坐上去就不想下来了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.16,2:02:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 苏鲁先生
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.75,2:02:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长这个头衔的确很风光
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.17,2:02:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,椅子物归原主 长官
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.42,2:02:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特先生
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.09,2:02:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲速核情况如何
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.17,2:02:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得正香 舰长
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.84,2:02:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已作好踏上漫长旅程的准备
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.22,2:02:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.51,2:02:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 老骨头 会很有趣的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.27,2:02:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在太空待五年 神啊救救我吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.81,2:02:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯博士
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.61,2:02:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你能加入我们这个大家庭
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.90,2:02:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有家的感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.03,2:02:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯波克
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.36,2:02:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.45,2:02:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去哪
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.29,2:02:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于如此长时间的任务史无前例
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.46,2:03:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你能作出正确的判断 舰长
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.97,2:03:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生 我们出发吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.07,2:03:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 舰长
